00:02:27.688 --> 00:02:30.983
This will not end in my death

00:02:31.192 --> 00:02:34.820
I long for my dream

00:02:35.029 --> 00:02:42.536
My faith in you sustains my life

00:02:42.745 --> 00:02:44.622
In the windswept wilderness

00:02:44.830 --> 00:02:46.457
Living with the butterflies and flowers

00:02:46.666 --> 00:02:50.252
Blooming together in a mirage of eternal Spring

00:02:50.461 --> 00:02:52.213
If my purity seems muddied

00:02:52.421 --> 00:02:54.090
And my body seems filthy

00:02:54.298 --> 00:02:57.968
Please believe in the finery within my heart

00:02:58.177 --> 00:03:03.641
Oh mother, I will show no tears

00:03:03.849 --> 00:03:07.353
They vanish like

00:03:07.561 --> 00:03:09.021
The dew in the grass beneath my feet

00:03:09.021 --> 00:03:14.026
"CODE GEASS Lelouch of the Rebellion Il
-Transgression-" The dew in the grass beneath my feet

00:03:14.026 --> 00:03:16.987
<i>"CODE GEASS
Lelouch of the Rebellion || -Transgression-"</i>

00:03:26.038 --> 00:03:28.791
Now then, I'll announce
our new organizational plan

00:03:28.999 --> 00:03:30.876
due to the reorganization of the Black Knights.

00:03:31.085 --> 00:03:34.046
The chief of military affairs
will now be Kyoshiro Tohdoh.

00:03:35.798 --> 00:03:37.675
In charge of general intelligence,

00:03:37.883 --> 00:03:40.094
including public relations,
spying, and liaison work...

00:03:40.302 --> 00:03:41.554
Diethard Reid.

00:03:41.762 --> 00:03:43.180
This Britannian?!

00:03:43.389 --> 00:03:45.349
Not just that, he's with the media!

00:03:45.558 --> 00:03:48.936
Zero, what's the reason for using a
Britannian in such an important position?

00:03:49.145 --> 00:03:50.604
Reason?

00:03:50.813 --> 00:03:52.523
Well then, what about me?

00:03:52.732 --> 00:03:56.068
As you all know, I'm not Japanese, either.

00:03:56.277 --> 00:03:59.113
What we need here
is the ability to get results!

00:03:59.321 --> 00:04:01.824
Race, past, and methods don't matter!

00:04:02.032 --> 00:04:04.493
All right! All right!

00:04:04.702 --> 00:04:06.537
My second in command is Kaname Ohgi.

00:04:06.746 --> 00:04:07.413
Me?

00:04:07.621 --> 00:04:08.456
You object?

00:04:08.664 --> 00:04:09.957
N-No...

00:04:10.166 --> 00:04:12.460
Well, Ohgi was our leader to begin with.

00:04:12.668 --> 00:04:14.378
| was getting worried
with all these newcomers.

00:04:14.587 --> 00:04:16.714
In charge of engineering
and development: Rakshata.

00:04:16.922 --> 00:04:18.007
Naturally.

00:04:18.215 --> 00:04:20.593
Commander of Zero Squad: Kallen Kozuki.

00:04:20.801 --> 00:04:21.802
"Zero Squad"?

00:04:22.011 --> 00:04:24.346
Zero Squad alone will be
under my direct control.

00:04:24.555 --> 00:04:26.682
You can think of it as a sort of royal guard.

00:04:26.891 --> 00:04:29.435
A royal guard... Zero's...!

00:04:29.643 --> 00:04:31.896
Commander of squad I will be Shougo Asahina.

00:04:32.104 --> 00:04:34.231
Commander of squad 2: Ryouga Senba.

00:04:34.440 --> 00:04:37.318
Commander of squad 3: Kizuna Kagesaki.

00:04:40.362 --> 00:04:42.156
| don't care if he's an honorary Britannian.

00:04:42.364 --> 00:04:44.033
Making an Eleven a knight is...!

00:04:44.241 --> 00:04:46.160
And authorizing it live on television!

00:04:46.368 --> 00:04:47.828
How'd he ever win her favor?

00:04:48.037 --> 00:04:52.124
Just look at her. Princess Euphemia's
an adolescent, after all.

00:04:54.877 --> 00:04:55.461
Are they serious?!

00:04:55.669 --> 00:04:57.046
This can't be happening!

00:04:57.254 --> 00:04:59.340
Not just that, but they
made an Eleven a major!

00:04:59.548 --> 00:05:00.925
Suzaku Kururugi.

00:05:01.133 --> 00:05:07.056
Wilt thou swear this day to do
battle as a knight of Britannia?

00:05:07.264 --> 00:05:08.849
Yes, Your Highness.

00:05:09.058 --> 00:05:13.395
Wilt thou abandon selfishness
and wish to be sword and shield

00:05:13.604 --> 00:05:15.523
for the sake of great justice?

00:05:15.731 --> 00:05:18.192
Yes, Your Highness.

00:05:31.956 --> 00:05:38.337
I, Euphemia li Britannia,
do dub thee Sir Suzaku Kururugi.

00:05:38.546 --> 00:05:40.673
--This is going to make his being attached to us complicated.
--May you be possessed of courage, integrity, humility, loyalty,

00:05:40.673 --> 00:05:42.174
--Lloyd seems to have spoken with them about that.
--May you be possessed of courage, integrity, humility, loyalty,

00:05:42.174 --> 00:05:43.384
--Lloyd seems to have spoken with them about that.
--civility, and dedication, and true to your convictions daily.

00:05:43.384 --> 00:05:44.635
--With Prince Schneizel?
--civility, and dedication, and true to your convictions daily.

00:05:44.844 --> 00:05:46.262
Yes.

00:06:29.763 --> 00:06:32.933
Commander of special forces squad 2:
Shinichiro Tamaki. That is all.

00:06:33.142 --> 00:06:34.268
Yes!

00:06:34.476 --> 00:06:37.646
Huh? No position for C.C.?

00:06:40.524 --> 00:06:42.943
We will now head for Shikine Island.

00:06:43.152 --> 00:06:44.904
Word is that dignitaries
from the Britannian mainland

00:06:45.112 --> 00:06:48.949
and Sub-Viceroy Euphemia
are holding a conference there.

00:06:49.158 --> 00:06:52.828
This is a chance to contact
Suzaku Kururugi, Euphemia's knight.

00:06:53.037 --> 00:06:56.248
Our mission objective is
to get Kururugi to join our side,

00:06:56.457 --> 00:06:59.043
not to kill him. Understood?

00:07:04.715 --> 00:07:09.178
Construction of the Thought Elevator
is proceeding as scheduled.

00:07:09.386 --> 00:07:11.805
Yes, I understand.

00:07:14.725 --> 00:07:16.393
Schneizel?

00:07:16.602 --> 00:07:19.355
Yes, Majesty. What's to be done about it?

00:07:19.563 --> 00:07:24.318
Let him do as he pleases. If he believes
in himself, let him challenge me.

00:07:27.279 --> 00:07:29.823
The Black Knights?
But how did they get here?!

00:07:33.035 --> 00:07:34.995
Squad 1, continue advancing!

00:07:35.204 --> 00:07:38.248
Zero Squad, give support fire
from squad 1's flank!

00:07:44.922 --> 00:07:47.049
That gal packs a hell of a punch!

00:07:51.720 --> 00:07:53.764
Impressive as always, Tohdoh.

00:07:53.973 --> 00:07:57.393
All I need to do now is wait
for this news to reach Euphemia.

00:08:01.522 --> 00:08:03.857
<i>You're just a garrison unit!</i>

00:08:05.776 --> 00:08:07.820
I'll finish him off!

00:08:17.246 --> 00:08:18.038
Zero!

00:08:18.247 --> 00:08:20.833
Come and get me, Suzaku!

00:08:22.251 --> 00:08:23.460
Target confirmed.

00:08:23.669 --> 00:08:26.255
All units, assume formation three and fall back.

00:08:26.463 --> 00:08:30.384
Do not fire on the target!
| say again, do not fire on the target!

00:08:30.592 --> 00:08:36.015
Yes, thanks to A.S.E.E.C.
Wha...? But, that would mean...!

00:08:36.223 --> 00:08:38.267
Yes, Your Highness!

00:08:49.820 --> 00:08:51.530
That's far enough, Zero!

00:08:51.739 --> 00:08:54.408
No, you're wrong, Suzaku!

00:08:54.616 --> 00:08:56.285
Take this.

00:08:56.493 --> 00:08:58.662
Gefjun Disturber!

00:09:03.584 --> 00:09:05.169
What the...?!

00:09:07.588 --> 00:09:08.881
| can't move!

00:09:13.135 --> 00:09:14.053
No good!

00:09:14.261 --> 00:09:17.222
| want to speak to you, Suzaku Kururugi!

00:09:17.431 --> 00:09:18.807
Will you please come out?

00:09:19.016 --> 00:09:21.602
Everything aside from your
primary power systems should still work.

00:09:21.810 --> 00:09:24.605
You'll be treated according
to international law as a prisoner.

00:09:24.813 --> 00:09:26.398
If you don't want to talk,

00:09:26.607 --> 00:09:30.194
you will be gunned down from all directions.

00:09:31.361 --> 00:09:34.406
| don't care! Please tell
Suzaku to exit the unit!

00:09:34.615 --> 00:09:37.534
Besides that, why isn't the Lancelot working?!

00:09:37.743 --> 00:09:40.871
The Sakuradite used
to power the Knightmare...

00:09:41.080 --> 00:09:42.623
Something's interfering with it!

00:09:42.831 --> 00:09:44.249
A Gefjun Disturber.

00:09:44.458 --> 00:09:45.084
You mean...!

00:09:45.292 --> 00:09:48.128
But it's also partially being used as a jammer.

00:09:48.337 --> 00:09:53.425
| thought it was just theoretical.
It really is you, isn't it? Rakshata...

00:09:54.259 --> 00:09:57.930
We still need to improve
the effective range and the duration.

00:09:59.848 --> 00:10:04.853
Suzaku Kururugi, I'll get straight
to the point. I want you to join me.

00:10:05.062 --> 00:10:06.688
Is that a threat?

00:10:06.897 --> 00:10:09.733
Even so, I refuse! I told you before,

00:10:09.942 --> 00:10:13.112
any results gained through
the wrong methods are meaningless!

00:10:13.320 --> 00:10:17.449
Then answer me this! Isn't the peace
we have now meaningless as well?

00:10:17.658 --> 00:10:20.744
What do you think would have happened
if Japan had chosen the course

00:10:20.953 --> 00:10:23.497
of do-or-die resistance seven years ago?

00:10:23.705 --> 00:10:25.624
The Chinese Federation and
the E.U. would have intervened,

00:10:25.833 --> 00:10:27.709
and Japan would have
been split into three parts.

00:10:27.918 --> 00:10:30.003
They'd probably still be fighting even now!

00:10:30.212 --> 00:10:36.218
In short, the current peace is the result
of an immediate unconditional surrender.

00:10:36.426 --> 00:10:41.682
Yes, that's right, and I've been fighting
to preserve the peace that my father built!

00:10:41.890 --> 00:10:44.810
No, you're wrong.

00:10:45.018 --> 00:10:48.147
It wasn't the cabinet, who put
Prime Minister Kururugi into his post,

00:10:48.355 --> 00:10:51.775
it was whoever killed him that
made the decision for everyone!

00:10:51.984 --> 00:10:54.111
The chain of command between
government and military collapsed,

00:10:54.319 --> 00:10:56.989
and surrender became
the only choice to make.

00:10:57.197 --> 00:11:00.367
Do you understand? The will of
the people was stolen from them.

00:11:00.576 --> 00:11:04.371
By a lone criminal who broke
the rules for his own selfish reasons!

00:11:04.580 --> 00:11:05.539
Can you hear what they're saying?

00:11:05.747 --> 00:11:08.834
There's too much static on the mic!

00:11:09.042 --> 00:11:10.794
How do you know that?

00:11:11.003 --> 00:11:13.797
There's only one way to atone for that.

00:11:14.006 --> 00:11:15.132
Huh?

00:11:15.340 --> 00:11:20.179
Present the Japanese people with
the choice they weren't able to make then.

00:11:20.387 --> 00:11:23.891
The path of fighting Britannia which
was robbed from them seven years ago.

00:11:24.099 --> 00:11:26.602
Fighting?! That again?!

00:11:26.810 --> 00:11:30.439
Then tell me this! Do you intend
to forever drive the masses

00:11:30.647 --> 00:11:33.567
towards a future dictated
by your own egotism?!

00:11:33.775 --> 00:11:36.236
You call that peace?!

00:11:37.779 --> 00:11:41.366
Do you read me, Maj. Kururugi? Respond!

00:11:41.575 --> 00:11:43.827
--May 1?
--As you wish.

00:11:44.036 --> 00:11:44.995
This is It. Colonel Fayer,

00:11:45.204 --> 00:11:47.915
commander of the Britannian base
here on Shikine Island.

00:11:48.123 --> 00:11:51.084
We're launching surface-to-surface
missiles against the terrorists!

00:11:51.293 --> 00:11:54.421
Maj. Kururugi, you are
ordered to keep Zero there!

00:11:54.630 --> 00:11:57.174
He's ordering his subordinate to die?!

00:12:00.385 --> 00:12:02.638
| can't approve of your methods!

00:12:02.846 --> 00:12:04.890
All I can do right now is this!

00:12:05.098 --> 00:12:07.476
Incoming missiles, confirmed!

00:12:10.687 --> 00:12:13.315
Zero, I'll save you!

00:12:13.523 --> 00:12:15.484
Dammit!

00:12:15.692 --> 00:12:19.488
You're going to die as well!
Do you really not mind that?!

00:12:19.696 --> 00:12:22.616
Maj. Kururugi, you won't be dying in vain!

00:12:22.824 --> 00:12:26.787
We'll be able to bury Zero, the traitor
to our homeland, once and for all!

00:12:26.995 --> 00:12:29.831
They'll be talking about
your bravery for generations to come!

00:12:30.040 --> 00:12:30.874
Shut up!

00:12:31.083 --> 00:12:34.503
All Knightmares, set up a barrage
against those incoming missiles!

00:12:34.711 --> 00:12:36.797
Empty your guns if you have to!

00:12:40.133 --> 00:12:42.803
Suzaku, let Zero go! It's me!

00:12:43.011 --> 00:12:46.598
It's me! Kallen Stadtfeld
from the student council!

00:12:46.807 --> 00:12:47.933
Look at me!

00:12:48.141 --> 00:12:50.519
A soldier has to follow his orders!

00:12:50.727 --> 00:12:53.939
Ha! Is that how you close yourself off?!

00:12:54.147 --> 00:12:55.774
How do you feel about this?!

00:12:55.983 --> 00:12:59.278
You're wrong! I'm doing this by my own rules!

00:13:08.787 --> 00:13:12.624
A float system?! Well, that beats me.

00:13:19.589 --> 00:13:23.302
Wh-What the...?!

00:13:23.510 --> 00:13:25.929
Suzaku! If you don't do something,
you're really going to die!

00:13:26.138 --> 00:13:28.015
Better that than breaking more rules!

00:13:28.223 --> 00:13:30.392
You stubborn fool!

00:13:33.186 --> 00:13:35.063
Live!

00:13:52.122 --> 00:13:56.001
Either they moved, they fled, or...

00:13:56.209 --> 00:14:00.172
Do I pursue them?
Lancelot and the red one have run away.

00:14:00.380 --> 00:14:01.965
There is no need.

00:14:02.174 --> 00:14:05.635
Sorry to pull you over here so suddenly, Anya.

00:14:05.844 --> 00:14:09.139
That's okay. I was on duty
on nearby Kamine Island anyway.

00:14:09.348 --> 00:14:11.975
Where's Suzaku? What happened to Suzaku?!

00:14:12.184 --> 00:14:13.560
We are checking on that now.

00:14:13.769 --> 00:14:17.064
Ah! Lancelot's signal has returned!

00:14:19.358 --> 00:14:21.234
Where am I?

00:14:27.574 --> 00:14:31.453
The reason they shot at Suzaku,
too, was to see how I would move?

00:14:31.661 --> 00:14:34.873
Who would do that?! Thanks to them, I...!

00:14:36.124 --> 00:14:37.918
Well, Kanon?

00:14:38.126 --> 00:14:40.921
His Majesty the Emperor's
actions are unusual, all right.

00:14:41.129 --> 00:14:43.840
Why would he dispatch a
reconnaissance team not to Shikine Island,

00:14:44.049 --> 00:14:45.550
but here, to Kamine Island?

00:14:45.759 --> 00:14:50.180
Anya said her mission was
to guard that island. What's over there?

00:14:50.389 --> 00:14:53.350
Ruins from over 5,000 years ago.

00:14:53.558 --> 00:14:55.394
Romanticism about the past is fine,

00:14:55.602 --> 00:14:58.772
but I wish he would
pay more attention to reality.

00:14:58.980 --> 00:15:02.609
He brought the Gawain to an analysis
of a similar set of ruins in Tanzania,

00:15:02.818 --> 00:15:05.112
where it was stolen by the Chinese Federation.

00:15:05.320 --> 00:15:08.490
That may have been an arbitrary move
by the Indian military district.

00:15:08.698 --> 00:15:12.077
Incidentally, regarding
Maj. Kururugi's violation of orders...

00:15:12.285 --> 00:15:15.080
Yeah, let's leave him off the hook for a bit.

00:15:15.288 --> 00:15:18.959
Since none of them shot
at him under those circumstances...

00:15:19.167 --> 00:15:21.628
You don't mean
he's a spy for the Black Knights?

00:15:21.837 --> 00:15:24.756
No, I don't think that's what it means.

00:15:24.965 --> 00:15:27.217
Besides, while the
Special Corps is one of ours,

00:15:27.426 --> 00:15:31.430
Kururugi himself is Euphy's knight, as well.

00:15:31.638 --> 00:15:37.144
I'm not accustomed to having
my little sister angry at me.

00:15:37.352 --> 00:15:40.021
Yes, it's true that the
Chinese Federation intervention

00:15:40.230 --> 00:15:41.982
and the terrorist acts of the Black Knights

00:15:42.190 --> 00:15:44.025
have caused all sorts
of disruption to our society.

00:15:44.234 --> 00:15:46.486
However, that is a completely
separate issue from this!

00:15:46.695 --> 00:15:49.656
The fact remains that you both
have been absent from class too often!

00:15:49.865 --> 00:15:51.700
| don't care how good your grades are,

00:15:51.908 --> 00:15:54.369
and I don't care that you're
Princess Euphemia's knight!

00:15:54.578 --> 00:15:57.831
If you don't have enough attendance days,
you have to repeat a year!

00:15:58.039 --> 00:15:59.541
Sounds like this will take a while still.

00:15:59.749 --> 00:16:01.877
She might go on all night.

00:16:12.012 --> 00:16:14.473
Hey, how long are you planning to stay here?

00:16:14.681 --> 00:16:18.810
You can't capture Cornelia,
and you can't get Kururugi to join you.

00:16:19.019 --> 00:16:21.813
It's too dangerous to stay here
in the middle of the settlement.

00:16:22.022 --> 00:16:26.485
Tactical-level failures mean nothing.
The mission is ongoing.

00:16:26.693 --> 00:16:29.279
Besides, until we establish
a place for Nunnally,

00:16:29.488 --> 00:16:31.448
it's safer inside the academy.

00:16:31.656 --> 00:16:34.326
It's you that I'm talking about.

00:16:34.534 --> 00:16:37.704
| can't have you dying on me
before you make good on our contract.

00:16:37.913 --> 00:16:43.168
Then tell me, what do I have to
do in return for receiving the Geass?

00:16:43.376 --> 00:16:45.837
I'll tell you when the time is right.

00:16:51.551 --> 00:16:54.679
What is this? Why is the paint so rushed?

00:16:54.888 --> 00:16:57.766
This is a Britannian prototype
that was seized in Tanzania.

00:16:57.974 --> 00:17:01.144
Ah, the one the Zevon family
had a hand in developing.

00:17:01.353 --> 00:17:04.564
It's equipped with a supercomputer
called the Druid System

00:17:04.773 --> 00:17:06.858
and has Hadron Cannons mounted.

00:17:07.067 --> 00:17:10.320
Who gets to collect data?
It is a new model and all.

00:17:10.529 --> 00:17:11.988
Zero will be fine, right?

00:17:12.197 --> 00:17:13.990
But it's a two-seater.

00:17:14.199 --> 00:17:17.619
There's that strange woman
who is always with him, isn't there?

00:17:17.827 --> 00:17:20.038
Or would you prefer someone like Tamaki?

00:17:20.247 --> 00:17:21.331
No, I didn't mean...

00:17:23.833 --> 00:17:26.253
Ladies and gentlemen,
the moment you've all been waiting for!

00:17:26.461 --> 00:17:28.797
The Ashford Academy school festival,

00:17:29.005 --> 00:17:32.217
the most open event in the
Tokyo Settlement, is about to begin!

00:17:32.425 --> 00:17:34.761
The start will be announced
by the following voice!

00:17:34.970 --> 00:17:36.763
Um, are you sure this is all right?

00:17:36.972 --> 00:17:37.847
It is!

00:17:38.056 --> 00:17:39.766
All right then.

00:17:39.975 --> 00:17:41.851
Meow!

00:17:44.604 --> 00:17:47.023
It's so noisy today.

00:17:47.232 --> 00:17:50.694
--Step right up, folks!
--Get your Britannian rolls!

00:17:50.902 --> 00:17:56.491
--See the shocking exposé, Document Zero!
--We have photos of Prince Clovis, too!

00:18:00.745 --> 00:18:04.291
Oh, another thing. The failure of the
Kyushu incident should be informative.

00:18:04.499 --> 00:18:06.793
Yeah. We've collected all the data

00:18:07.002 --> 00:18:10.880
on the emergency
countermeasures used in all sectors.

00:18:11.089 --> 00:18:12.966
We've ascertained the solar panels
used in each settlement

00:18:13.174 --> 00:18:16.469
as well as the associated
energy storage sites.

00:18:16.678 --> 00:18:18.221
What about those
underground collaborators?

00:18:18.430 --> 00:18:22.350
| can handle that by myself.
I've already checked 72 percent of them.

00:18:22.559 --> 00:18:23.310
What about Tohdoh?

00:18:23.518 --> 00:18:26.813
He's working up a list of occupation targets.

00:18:27.022 --> 00:18:28.732
| want you to you check on them,

00:18:28.940 --> 00:18:31.693
including the dummy plan
documents being sent to Kyoto.

00:18:31.901 --> 00:18:34.487
Gotcha. I'll confirm that tomorrow.

00:18:34.696 --> 00:18:37.157
Oh, and I know we're late
in reporting this to you,

00:18:37.365 --> 00:18:40.285
--but the Zero Squad commander will be at Ashford Academy...
--Trouble!

00:18:40.493 --> 00:18:42.078
Major, major trouble!

00:18:42.287 --> 00:18:44.998
I'll contact you later!

00:18:45.206 --> 00:18:46.041
Trouble?

00:18:46.249 --> 00:18:49.836
What are you goofing off for?!
You're the executive chairman, aren't you?!

00:18:50.045 --> 00:18:52.422
But things are running without a problem!

00:18:52.631 --> 00:18:55.342
Besides, you're in charge, aren't you?

00:18:55.550 --> 00:18:58.428
It was two meters wide till last year,
but then you suddenly declared

00:18:58.637 --> 00:19:00.221
we had to have a twelve-meter pizza this year!

00:19:00.430 --> 00:19:01.681
Yeah, isn't it amazing?

00:19:01.890 --> 00:19:04.351
Once it's finished, it'll be the
largest one of its type in the world!

00:19:04.559 --> 00:19:07.354
Just the oven and ingredients
alone are causing an uproar.

00:19:07.562 --> 00:19:11.524
And now a TV crew's here?
Don't you know we can't show our faces?!

00:19:11.733 --> 00:19:15.612
But we have to record making the pizza!
You can just man the booth, okay?

00:19:15.820 --> 00:19:17.697
President's orders.

00:19:23.662 --> 00:19:25.288
That's a relief.

00:19:25.497 --> 00:19:27.582
| thought you'd never come back to school.

00:19:27.791 --> 00:19:29.751
| knew it! You did hear me!

00:19:29.959 --> 00:19:32.921
Why didn't you tell anyone?
About who I really am?!

00:19:33.129 --> 00:19:37.967
You're Kallen Stadtfeld right now,
aren't you? Not Kallen Kozuki.

00:19:39.344 --> 00:19:41.596
Are you trying to lure me
in by showing me mercy?

00:19:41.805 --> 00:19:44.307
If we meet on the battlefield,
| won't show you any mercy.

00:19:44.516 --> 00:19:46.643
But I want to keep trying to persuade you.

00:19:46.851 --> 00:19:49.562
| realize this is against the rules,

00:19:49.771 --> 00:19:54.234
but at school, I'd rather
choose persuasion over fighting.

00:19:54.442 --> 00:19:57.654
Suzaku, the truck's here with the cheese...

00:19:57.862 --> 00:19:58.988
You came?

00:19:59.197 --> 00:20:02.450
Y-Yeah. I'm not as sick now, so...

00:20:02.659 --> 00:20:06.037
Kallen, what we were talking about
has nothing to do with school, okay?

00:20:06.246 --> 00:20:08.206
Gotcha.

00:20:09.582 --> 00:20:12.377
Good work, bringing them here
from Area 18 in one night.

00:20:12.585 --> 00:20:14.713
Your forces are excellent, Cornelia.

00:20:14.921 --> 00:20:16.131
You flatter me.

00:20:16.339 --> 00:20:20.468
I'm honored you could get your regular
forces to fill in for them, my brother.

00:20:20.677 --> 00:20:22.679
It was the least I could do.

00:20:22.887 --> 00:20:25.640
And combined with the Glaston Knights
on stand-by in the homeland.

00:20:25.849 --> 00:20:29.185
Now my forces look the way they should.

00:20:29.394 --> 00:20:31.563
We even have Sattel Waffes
for the Gloucesters.

00:20:31.771 --> 00:20:34.524
| know. I'm going to play
this card in my negotiations

00:20:34.733 --> 00:20:36.443
with the Chinese Federation.

00:20:36.651 --> 00:20:37.944
Please do.

00:20:38.153 --> 00:20:39.237
What an honor.

00:20:39.446 --> 00:20:40.071
Huh?

00:20:40.280 --> 00:20:41.948
Being asked to do something
by Princess Cornelia,

00:20:42.157 --> 00:20:44.868
who is unmatched on the battlefield.

00:20:45.076 --> 00:20:46.536
Please don't tease me.

00:20:46.745 --> 00:20:51.332
It's true. On the battlefield,
you shine more beautifully and brightly

00:20:51.541 --> 00:20:53.293
than any flower or butterfly at a ball.

00:20:53.501 --> 00:20:56.755
Yes, like the Flash herself.

00:20:56.963 --> 00:20:59.674
Please, stop saying
that about me. I'm just...

00:20:59.883 --> 00:21:03.970
Where could Euphy have gotten to?
We are supposed to be seeing you off.

00:21:04.179 --> 00:21:06.514
| spoke with Euphy last night.

00:21:06.723 --> 00:21:07.515
Last night?

00:21:07.724 --> 00:21:08.641
Mm-hmm.

00:21:08.850 --> 00:21:11.811
Oh, and about that matter
Bartley's in charge of...

00:21:12.020 --> 00:21:16.232
Oh, yes, I don't mind,
but will that really be of any use to us?

00:21:22.197 --> 00:21:25.867
I'm so sorry, but there's something
| must speak to Suzaku about.

00:21:26.075 --> 00:21:26.993
It's all right, Your Highness.

00:21:27.202 --> 00:21:31.706
Suzaku, my brother's
approved my idea. Now we can...

00:21:33.333 --> 00:21:35.126
I'm so sorry! Are you all right?

00:21:35.335 --> 00:21:37.796
I'm fine. Are you all right?

00:21:38.004 --> 00:21:38.880
Nunnally?!

00:21:39.088 --> 00:21:42.008
Huh? That voice... Can it be...?

00:21:42.217 --> 00:21:47.347
Is it really you, Nunnally?
| can't believe you're alive!

00:21:51.059 --> 00:21:55.522
| see... Lelouch turned
to the Ashford family...

00:21:55.730 --> 00:21:59.734
Will you stay quiet about this?
About my brother and me?

00:21:59.943 --> 00:22:01.528
But, if you stay like this...

00:22:01.736 --> 00:22:05.490
All I want to do is to stay with my brother.

00:22:08.368 --> 00:22:11.871
Do you remember the
time we had that argument?

00:22:12.080 --> 00:22:15.124
About which of us was going
to marry my big brother?

00:22:15.333 --> 00:22:21.756
| do! Where we put Lelouch on the spot
by demanding he decide that night!

00:22:21.965 --> 00:22:22.465
And now?

00:22:22.674 --> 00:22:24.384
Huh?

00:22:24.592 --> 00:22:27.262
Do you still love my brother, even now?

00:22:34.853 --> 00:22:36.855
Hello there!

00:22:37.063 --> 00:22:41.276
Tell me, have you seen Maj. Kururugi?
They said he was here... Hm?

00:22:41.484 --> 00:22:44.571
Ah! Looks like you're working
on some fun stuff here!

00:22:44.779 --> 00:22:45.864
You understand it?

00:22:46.072 --> 00:22:49.117
Uranium, right? The one with
an atomic mass of 235, I see.

00:22:49.325 --> 00:22:54.163
Yes, that's right! If you can get this
uranium 235 to absorb active neutrons,

00:22:54.372 --> 00:22:57.125
it should cause it to split into two atomic
nuclei and high-speed neutrons!

00:22:57.333 --> 00:23:01.880
Oh? You wouldn't be the girl who won
that one incentive award, would you?

00:23:02.088 --> 00:23:03.798
Huh? You know about that?

00:23:04.007 --> 00:23:07.594
Mm-hmm. Princess Euphemia
says that you have great talent.

00:23:07.802 --> 00:23:12.849
Huh? Princess Euphemia said that?
Oh, wow. I'm so happy.

00:23:15.143 --> 00:23:17.353
All right! Any moment now!

00:23:17.562 --> 00:23:21.232
Any moment now, we begin!
The making of the world's largest pizza!

00:23:21.441 --> 00:23:23.776
Incidentally, I'd like to note
that this thing at my feet

00:23:23.985 --> 00:23:26.571
is an oven specially built just for this!

00:23:26.779 --> 00:23:28.948
A fabulous waste of money! A fabulous...

00:23:29.157 --> 00:23:32.535
| understand, Shirley.
| promise I'll make time for you.

00:23:32.744 --> 00:23:35.413
Just send out group B to help with the stage.

00:23:35.622 --> 00:23:38.791
Right.

00:23:39.000 --> 00:23:43.254
It's not as though anyone is going
to die if someone makes a mistake.

00:23:43.463 --> 00:23:46.341
Not bad at all. Looks like it's
all going to schedule, huh?

00:23:46.549 --> 00:23:49.344
I've learned how to manage people lately.

00:23:49.552 --> 00:23:52.138
Still, everyone seems
so optimistic, don't they?

00:23:52.347 --> 00:23:53.222
Even though the Chinese Federation

00:23:53.431 --> 00:23:55.934
and the Black Knights are
starting to become more active.

00:23:56.142 --> 00:23:56.935
It just proves something.

00:23:57.143 --> 00:23:57.769
Huh?

00:23:57.977 --> 00:24:02.273
Festivals are necessary.
For everyone, at all times.

00:24:02.482 --> 00:24:05.109
You still have lots to learn.

00:24:05.318 --> 00:24:06.486
Lesson learned!

00:24:06.694 --> 00:24:07.570
Big brother!

00:24:07.779 --> 00:24:09.822
Nunnally! How's the pizza doing...

00:24:13.242 --> 00:24:16.204
Sorry! Give me a sec!
Call me if something happens!

00:24:17.121 --> 00:24:19.999
It looks like the preparation
of the ingredients is complete!

00:24:20.208 --> 00:24:22.001
Now then, allow me to introduce...

00:24:22.210 --> 00:24:26.130
...our dough tosser,
the Ashford family Ganymede!

00:24:26.339 --> 00:24:28.174
Yes, it's a bit of a classic.

00:24:28.383 --> 00:24:32.095
However, at the controls is the
student council's dress-code monitor,

00:24:32.303 --> 00:24:33.930
the knight of Princess Euphemia,

00:24:34.138 --> 00:24:37.225
Suzaku Kururugi!

00:24:37.433 --> 00:24:39.477
What? Do you mean...?

00:24:39.686 --> 00:24:42.188
Yes. A lot of Elevens
have come for this, too.

00:24:42.397 --> 00:24:45.733
It's an open festival after all,
and this is Suzaku's school.

00:24:45.942 --> 00:24:46.859
Just for that?

00:24:47.068 --> 00:24:51.864
Yes. Suzaku is a star
of hope for many Elevens.

00:24:52.073 --> 00:24:52.907
| see...

00:24:53.116 --> 00:24:55.576
Ganymede, a third-generation Knightmare.

00:24:55.785 --> 00:24:59.163
The type used by Lady Marianne
the Flash, correct?

00:24:59.372 --> 00:25:02.875
It's just a basic frame.
A big puppet for events like this.

00:25:03.084 --> 00:25:04.711
It's an unorthodox design
that was dropped from competing

00:25:04.919 --> 00:25:08.214
for the next generation of Frame
because of Lady Marianne's death.

00:25:08.423 --> 00:25:11.884
I'm guessing that's the real
reason you want to marry me.

00:25:12.093 --> 00:25:16.347
It seems so. He has no interest
at all when it comes to marriage.

00:25:16.556 --> 00:25:20.059
How unfortunate! I only know the systems!

00:25:20.268 --> 00:25:23.896
Outstanding! How large can he make it?!

00:25:24.105 --> 00:25:26.733
C'mon, Sir Suzaku!
We've got high hopes for you!

00:25:26.941 --> 00:25:30.945
It was my turn last year,
but I can't compare to a real pro.

00:25:31.154 --> 00:25:33.239
Today is a day of nothing but surprises.

00:25:33.448 --> 00:25:35.283
To think you and Nunnally were still alive,

00:25:35.491 --> 00:25:38.119
and that you're Suzaku's friend, too!

00:25:38.327 --> 00:25:40.788
What is Lulu doing?!

00:25:40.997 --> 00:25:44.917
Here I haven't been able to
reach him for a while, and this is why?

00:25:45.126 --> 00:25:48.629
If word gets out in the
homeland that we're still alive,

00:25:48.838 --> 00:25:52.133
then we're at risk of being
targeted by whoever killed our mother.

00:25:52.341 --> 00:25:54.218
I'd like to refrain from
meeting as much as possible.

00:25:54.427 --> 00:25:56.846
It's okay. I've found a good solution for us.

00:25:57.055 --> 00:25:59.974
| came today to tell Suzaku about it.

00:26:00.183 --> 00:26:01.100
A solution?

00:26:01.309 --> 00:26:04.687
Yes. I haven't told Sister yet, but Schneizel--

00:26:04.896 --> 00:26:08.691
| have an idea.
Can you get me together with Cornelia?

00:26:08.900 --> 00:26:11.360
Just the two of us, if possible.

00:26:11.569 --> 00:26:14.238
Lelouch, you wouldn't happen to be...

00:26:14.447 --> 00:26:16.199
Lulu...

00:26:20.745 --> 00:26:22.789
Huh? Princess Euphemia?!

00:26:22.997 --> 00:26:23.372
Huh?

00:26:23.581 --> 00:26:24.999
Princess Euphemia?

00:26:25.208 --> 00:26:26.793
Huh? What's up?

00:26:27.001 --> 00:26:27.710
Over there?

00:26:27.919 --> 00:26:29.587
It's true! It's Princess Euphemial!

00:26:29.796 --> 00:26:31.047
Princess Euphemia?!

00:26:31.255 --> 00:26:32.590
Lelouch! Get Nunnally out of here!

00:26:32.799 --> 00:26:34.133
Sorry, but I will!

00:26:34.342 --> 00:26:37.011
Right! The sub-viceroy
is near the main entrance!

00:26:37.220 --> 00:26:39.180
Roger! I'll send in the stand-by team!

00:26:39.388 --> 00:26:41.390
Camera! Get a link to the studio!

00:26:41.599 --> 00:26:43.351
--Yeah!
--Princess Euphemia's come here!

00:26:43.559 --> 00:26:44.060
No way! Why?!

00:26:44.268 --> 00:26:45.812
Where?! Where is she?!

00:26:46.020 --> 00:26:49.816
Stop! Don't run! It'll collapse!

00:26:57.281 --> 00:26:58.950
The pizza...

00:26:59.158 --> 00:27:01.702
Should we have left this to the pros?

00:27:01.911 --> 00:27:05.998
I'm afraid we may have to give up
on this and some other things for now.

00:27:08.793 --> 00:27:10.086
You don't say.

00:27:10.294 --> 00:27:15.883
No, I'm glad you made it without
having to use our vehicle, Miss Kozuki.

00:27:16.092 --> 00:27:17.468
Right.

00:27:17.677 --> 00:27:20.763
Looks like we wasted
the equipment space in the relay car.

00:27:20.972 --> 00:27:23.432
There was no issue with
the commander of Zero Squad.

00:27:23.641 --> 00:27:27.895
But I'd like you to stay under
cover here in the settlement.

00:27:28.104 --> 00:27:29.939
I'll introduce you to Zero later on.

00:27:30.148 --> 00:27:31.232
| understand.

00:27:31.440 --> 00:27:31.899
Huh?

00:27:32.108 --> 00:27:33.943
Oh, boy...

00:27:36.112 --> 00:27:38.072
Are you all right, Princess Euphemia?!

00:27:38.281 --> 00:27:40.867
Oh! Thank you, Suzaku!

00:27:41.075 --> 00:27:42.535
Are you all right, Nunnally?

00:27:42.743 --> 00:27:45.037
Yes. And Euphemia?

00:27:45.246 --> 00:27:46.998
She's fine. Suzaku saved her.

00:27:47.206 --> 00:27:48.624
| see...

00:27:48.833 --> 00:27:51.544
Princess Euphemia,
can I get a comment, please?

00:27:51.752 --> 00:27:54.964
Is this video being carried
to the entire Area?

00:27:55.173 --> 00:27:56.841
Huh? You mean you want to go live?

00:27:57.049 --> 00:27:57.925
Euphy?

00:27:58.134 --> 00:27:59.927
I've an important announcement to make!

00:28:00.136 --> 00:28:02.054
We take you now to our emergency hook-up.

00:28:02.263 --> 00:28:07.643
| am Euphemia, Sub-Viceroy of
Area 11 of the Holy Britannian Empire.

00:28:07.852 --> 00:28:11.314
There is something I wish to tell you all today!

00:28:11.522 --> 00:28:14.817
Now what? The little girl
is making such a fuss.

00:28:15.026 --> 00:28:18.821
I, Euphemia li Britannia,
do hereby declare the formation

00:28:19.030 --> 00:28:23.284
of the specially administrated zone
of Nippon in the area around Mt. Fuji!

00:28:23.492 --> 00:28:25.286
What?! Britannia has...?!

00:28:25.494 --> 00:28:27.455
They're... recognizing Japan?!

00:28:27.663 --> 00:28:32.668
Dammit! That's their game now?!
Even if it's just a limited area!

00:28:32.877 --> 00:28:34.921
Within the specially
administrated zone of Nippon,

00:28:35.129 --> 00:28:39.300
Elevens may go back
to calling themselves Japanese.

00:28:39.508 --> 00:28:43.054
Restrictions against Elevens
and special rights for Britannians

00:28:43.262 --> 00:28:45.890
will not exist within the zone of Nippon.

00:28:46.098 --> 00:28:50.686
It will be a world where Elevens
and Britannians will live as equals!

00:28:50.895 --> 00:28:53.481
Like hell, equals!
Imagine, them pulling this!

00:28:53.689 --> 00:28:57.068
The condition for living in this
special zone is probably disarmament.

00:28:57.276 --> 00:28:59.612
But if we don't,
we'll be the enemies of peace.

00:28:59.820 --> 00:29:02.448
What do we do, Tohdoh?

00:29:22.009 --> 00:29:25.263
Over twenty thousand people have
applied to join the Nippon special zone.

00:29:25.471 --> 00:29:27.890
The way things look,
that number's just going to grow.

00:29:28.099 --> 00:29:29.308
Thanks to you.

00:29:29.517 --> 00:29:30.059
Huh?

00:29:30.268 --> 00:29:33.104
It's because you are representing
the Japanese people

00:29:33.312 --> 00:29:36.023
that everyone believes
in what we're doing here.

00:29:36.232 --> 00:29:40.653
No... It must be because of the
proclamation you made, Princess.

00:29:40.861 --> 00:29:43.114
I'm thankful for this. Truly thankful.

00:29:43.322 --> 00:29:45.950
As I am to you.

00:29:46.158 --> 00:29:48.703
| hope you'll help me with
everything that's still to come.

00:29:48.911 --> 00:29:51.956
--Yes, Your...
--Please.

00:29:52.164 --> 00:29:53.291
Right.

00:29:54.834 --> 00:29:55.668
Come to think of it,

00:29:55.876 --> 00:29:59.547
who were the people you mentioned
the other day that you wanted me to meet?

00:29:59.755 --> 00:30:02.925
That's a secret until
the special zone is underway.

00:30:12.143 --> 00:30:12.601
I'm home.

00:30:12.810 --> 00:30:16.022
Welcome home, big brother. Where's Shirley?

00:30:16.230 --> 00:30:19.734
She was in a bad mood over something
all during dinner and afterward, too.

00:30:19.942 --> 00:30:21.569
More of her getting back at you, huh?

00:30:21.777 --> 00:30:23.904
You seem sort of cold towards her lately.

00:30:24.113 --> 00:30:26.324
You think so? I'll consider that.

00:30:26.532 --> 00:30:28.951
Oh, Sayoko, could you
bring us some tea, please?

00:30:29.160 --> 00:30:31.370
Yes, as you wish.

00:30:35.833 --> 00:30:38.377
Are you worried about something?

00:30:38.586 --> 00:30:39.170
Huh?

00:30:39.378 --> 00:30:42.214
Is it about Euphy?

00:30:42.423 --> 00:30:45.009
| won't be selfish and
say I want to see her again.

00:30:45.217 --> 00:30:48.971
It would just cause
trouble for you and Euphy.

00:30:49.180 --> 00:30:50.514
You like Euphy, don't you?

00:30:50.723 --> 00:30:53.351
Yes. You like her too, don't you?

00:30:53.559 --> 00:30:54.852
Yeah.

00:30:55.061 --> 00:30:56.437
| did like her.

00:31:01.734 --> 00:31:03.778
Princess Euphemia, it's time.

00:31:03.986 --> 00:31:05.905
Right.

00:31:16.165 --> 00:31:17.375
Zero.

00:31:19.502 --> 00:31:22.254
He came after all!

00:31:22.463 --> 00:31:25.007
You accept that you've lost?

00:31:33.682 --> 00:31:37.228
Your target is Zero. If he makes any
suspicious moves, kill him at once.

00:31:37.436 --> 00:31:39.313
Yes, my lord.

00:31:39.522 --> 00:31:42.566
Welcome, Zero! Welcome to the
specially administrated zone of Nippon!

00:31:42.775 --> 00:31:47.238
Euphemia li Britannia!
| sincerely wish to speak with you!

00:31:47.446 --> 00:31:48.656
With me?

00:31:48.864 --> 00:31:51.450
Yes! With you alone!

00:31:51.659 --> 00:31:53.035
Something major has happened,
ladies and gentlemen!

00:31:53.244 --> 00:31:55.955
Zero has boldly appeared!

00:31:56.163 --> 00:31:59.708
Under Princess Euphemia's directions,
he is moving toward G1.

00:31:59.917 --> 00:32:02.670
| knew we should have gone there.

00:32:02.878 --> 00:32:04.171
What choice did we have?

00:32:04.380 --> 00:32:10.219
Everyone said that if Lancelot
was there waiting, Zero wouldn't show.

00:32:10.428 --> 00:32:12.346
There doesn't seem
to be any obvious problem.

00:32:12.555 --> 00:32:13.514
Then this way, please.

00:32:13.722 --> 00:32:17.685
Princess Euphemia, it's dangerous
to be alone with this man!

00:32:17.893 --> 00:32:19.562
At least let me come with you!

00:32:19.770 --> 00:32:23.357
It's all right. Please, just trust me.

00:32:26.569 --> 00:32:30.197
C'mon, how long are
we supposed to hang around here?

00:32:30.406 --> 00:32:33.075
Wasn't having Zero tell us
to wait here enough for you?

00:32:33.284 --> 00:32:34.660
Yeah, but...

00:32:34.869 --> 00:32:37.788
Everything starts after we confirm
the Britannians' real intentions.

00:32:37.997 --> 00:32:38.581
Deputy Commander?

00:32:38.789 --> 00:32:39.790
Hm? Yes?

00:32:39.999 --> 00:32:44.211
| would assume he has us covering all their exits
precisely because he does know their intentions.

00:32:44.420 --> 00:32:45.880
It's dangerous to draw conclusions.

00:32:46.088 --> 00:32:48.966
He's even got Diethard
and Rakshata standing by.

00:32:49.175 --> 00:32:52.011
| think he may be planning to kill Euphemia...

00:32:54.096 --> 00:32:57.725
You're taking a lot of care, aren't you?
The cameras are already off.

00:32:57.933 --> 00:32:59.894
Because I've been in hiding for a long time.

00:33:00.102 --> 00:33:01.562
The fault of a certain empire, I'm afraid.

00:33:01.770 --> 00:33:04.648
You see?! I knew it was you, Lelouch!

00:33:06.358 --> 00:33:10.154
You're a sharp one, all right.
This is why I didn't want to meet with you.

00:33:10.362 --> 00:33:12.531
Still, if you've taken your mask off,

00:33:12.740 --> 00:33:14.325
it means you're going to work with me, right?

00:33:14.533 --> 00:33:18.162
No, I just wanted to see you
face-to-face one last time.

00:33:18.370 --> 00:33:19.371
Huh?

00:33:19.580 --> 00:33:22.583
This is a needle gun,
made from ceramic and bamboo.

00:33:22.791 --> 00:33:24.668
It can't be picked up on a detector.

00:33:24.877 --> 00:33:27.713
Lelouch... You wouldn't
shoot me, would you?

00:33:27.922 --> 00:33:33.594
No, I wouldn't.
You'll be doing the shooting, Euphy.

00:33:33.802 --> 00:33:36.514
Is this really all right,
leaving her alone with Zero?

00:33:36.722 --> 00:33:38.265
But she ordered us!

00:33:38.474 --> 00:33:41.435
There's an emergency
call button she can press.

00:33:55.866 --> 00:33:57.701
Huh?

00:33:57.910 --> 00:33:58.911
What's wrong?

00:33:59.119 --> 00:34:01.497
What are you doing with Zero?!

00:34:01.705 --> 00:34:03.541
It looks like he can see me.

00:34:03.749 --> 00:34:07.586
Is it because of our indirect contact
and what happened at Kamine Island?

00:34:07.795 --> 00:34:11.966
Or is it because he...?
But, if that's the case, then...

00:34:13.425 --> 00:34:16.637
This ceremony is being broadcast worldwide.

00:34:16.845 --> 00:34:20.057
And the world's going to see you,
a Britannian princess, shoot Zero.

00:34:20.266 --> 00:34:21.600
What do you think will happen then?

00:34:21.809 --> 00:34:23.686
Violence would break out, I imagine.

00:34:23.894 --> 00:34:28.023
Right. Zero will become a martyr,
tricked into a deathtrap,

00:34:28.232 --> 00:34:30.234
and your popularity
will crash to the ground.

00:34:30.442 --> 00:34:33.946
What kind of nonsense are you saying?
Help me rebuild Japan...

00:34:34.154 --> 00:34:36.115
If you arbitrarily push it
upon us from on high,

00:34:36.323 --> 00:34:39.243
you're being just as bad as Clovis was!

00:34:39.451 --> 00:34:42.246
All conditions for this
situation have been cleared.

00:34:42.454 --> 00:34:43.581
After hovering near death,

00:34:43.789 --> 00:34:46.208
Zero will be cheered when
he makes a miraculous recovery.

00:34:46.417 --> 00:34:50.212
People don't care about reason.
But they can't resist a good miracle.

00:34:50.421 --> 00:34:52.131
Now, take the gun.

00:34:52.339 --> 00:34:53.507
Huh?

00:34:53.716 --> 00:34:55.926
There can be only one messiah.

00:34:56.135 --> 00:35:00.055
Once they see you're
a false one, the people will...

00:35:00.264 --> 00:35:01.807
I... I thought so!

00:35:02.016 --> 00:35:05.686
Just tell me one thing! Are you...

00:35:08.564 --> 00:35:10.608
No... He's reached that point?!

00:35:10.816 --> 00:35:12.443
Hey! What's wrong?!

00:35:22.786 --> 00:35:23.912
Maj. Kururugi!

00:35:24.121 --> 00:35:26.624
Why, you...! What have you done?!

00:35:30.794 --> 00:35:31.378
Lelouch!

00:35:31.587 --> 00:35:34.715
Stop it! Stop giving me your pity!

00:35:34.923 --> 00:35:36.258
| won't take your charity!

00:35:36.467 --> 00:35:38.802
| have to try and achieve this on my own!

00:35:39.011 --> 00:35:43.891
And for that, I'll stain your hands
with blood, Euphemia li Britannia!

00:35:44.099 --> 00:35:47.436
I've given up that name!

00:35:47.645 --> 00:35:50.356
There'll probably be an
announcement from the homeland soon,

00:35:50.564 --> 00:35:53.317
but I've given up my claim to the throne!

00:35:53.525 --> 00:35:57.404
Why? Not because you accepted Zero, is it?

00:35:57.613 --> 00:36:02.951
A price had to be paid for
doing something this selfish, right?

00:36:04.536 --> 00:36:07.456
It's easy for you to give it up, isn't it?

00:36:07.665 --> 00:36:10.084
| suppose you did it for my sake.

00:36:10.292 --> 00:36:14.046
You're as conceited as ever,
| see. I did it for Nunnally!

00:36:14.254 --> 00:36:15.756
She told me herself.

00:36:15.964 --> 00:36:20.803
"As long as I can be with my brother,
| don't need anything else."”

00:36:21.011 --> 00:36:22.346
And that's why you...?!

00:36:22.554 --> 00:36:25.391
And that's what made up my mind.

00:36:25.599 --> 00:36:29.895
It made me consider
what was truly important to me.

00:36:30.104 --> 00:36:35.859
So do you see, Lelouch? I'm not giving up
anything that's truly important to me.

00:36:36.068 --> 00:36:40.197
And don't worry!
| won't tell anyone about you!

00:36:41.115 --> 00:36:42.241
And Cornelia?

00:36:42.449 --> 00:36:44.952
It's not like we'll never see each other again.

00:36:45.160 --> 00:36:48.122
You're a fool. An amazing fool.

00:36:48.330 --> 00:36:53.502
| may not have ever been able to beat
you at games or studies, Lelouch, but...

00:36:53.711 --> 00:36:59.383
But in your own rash way,
you ended up winning it all.

00:36:59.591 --> 00:37:04.096
When I think about it, more than
being the sub-viceroy or a princess,

00:37:04.304 --> 00:37:05.931
you were always just plain little Euphy.

00:37:06.140 --> 00:37:09.601
Then will you do this with plain little Euphy?

00:37:14.314 --> 00:37:20.237
You... You are the worst enemy I ever faced.

00:37:20.446 --> 00:37:22.698
You win.

00:37:22.906 --> 00:37:25.909
Let's figure out a better use
for this special zone of yours.

00:37:26.118 --> 00:37:28.537
Oh, but I won't act as
your subordinate, all right?

00:37:28.746 --> 00:37:32.374
Right! Still, you don't have
much faith in me, do you?

00:37:32.583 --> 00:37:35.836
Did you really think you could get me
to shoot you just by threatening me?

00:37:36.044 --> 00:37:38.380
Ha-ha, that's not it.

00:37:38.589 --> 00:37:41.842
If I really order someone
to do something, no one can resist.

00:37:42.050 --> 00:37:46.305
To shoot me, to dismiss Suzaku,
any order at all.

00:37:46.513 --> 00:37:48.891
Oh, you're just being silly now.

00:37:49.099 --> 00:37:52.978
I'm serious! For example,
if I told you, "Kill all the Japanese,"

00:37:53.187 --> 00:37:55.522
it wouldn't matter how you felt about it...

00:37:58.358 --> 00:38:02.988
No... Please, I don't... No!

00:38:03.197 --> 00:38:06.742
| don't want to kill them!

00:38:06.950 --> 00:38:08.702
No...!

00:38:11.205 --> 00:38:13.165
Did I...2!

00:38:13.999 --> 00:38:18.128
You're right. I have to kill the Japanese.

00:38:18.337 --> 00:38:21.757
Forget the order I just gave you! Euphy!

00:38:21.965 --> 00:38:23.759
Euphy, wait!

00:38:23.967 --> 00:38:26.929
Right, I've completed the talks
with the Chinese Federation,

00:38:27.137 --> 00:38:28.972
so I'll be returning to the homeland today.

00:38:29.181 --> 00:38:31.850
Then we should keep the
experimental adapted organism here.

00:38:32.059 --> 00:38:33.936
Right. How's his intelligence look?

00:38:34.144 --> 00:38:36.563
There's only so much
we can do here in Area 11.

00:38:36.772 --> 00:38:40.567
| see. We should ask the
Rosenberg Institute about that.

00:38:40.776 --> 00:38:44.571
Can you send him and the test unit
over there after I make the arrangements?

00:38:44.780 --> 00:38:48.075
Understood, Your Highness.
That just leaves the Kamine Island ruins...

00:38:48.283 --> 00:38:51.286
It'll have to wait till the security
situation in Area 11 has stabilized.

00:38:51.495 --> 00:38:53.163
That's what the specially
administrated zone is for.

00:38:53.372 --> 00:38:59.127
Thanks to Euphemia, it looks like
everything's going to work out perfectly.

00:38:59.336 --> 00:39:00.963
Sub-Viceroy, where's Zero?!

00:39:01.171 --> 00:39:03.298
All of you who call yourselves Japanese...

00:39:03.507 --> 00:39:06.718
| have a favor to ask!
Could you all die, please?

00:39:06.927 --> 00:39:08.512
--What did she just say?
--No way...

00:39:08.720 --> 00:39:10.013
It's a joke, right?

00:39:11.515 --> 00:39:13.016
Suzaku!

00:39:13.225 --> 00:39:15.519
He's just unconscious. But why?!

00:39:15.727 --> 00:39:17.062
Umm...

00:39:17.271 --> 00:39:20.607
| was hoping you'd commit suicide,
but you won't, will you?

00:39:20.816 --> 00:39:25.529
Well then, soldiers,
please kill them all. Wipe them out!

00:39:25.737 --> 00:39:27.072
Wha--? She's serious?!

00:39:27.281 --> 00:39:28.949
Cut the mics and cameras!

00:39:29.157 --> 00:39:30.242
Euphy, no!

00:39:30.450 --> 00:39:31.410
Halt!

00:39:31.618 --> 00:39:32.369
Out of my way!

00:39:32.578 --> 00:39:35.330
--Damn terrorist!
--Stand aside!

00:39:43.964 --> 00:39:46.133
Go on, soldiers! Hurry!

00:39:46.341 --> 00:39:47.217
Princess Euphemial!

00:39:47.426 --> 00:39:49.177
What's come over you?!

00:39:49.386 --> 00:39:52.055
Stop this, please! This is...

00:39:53.807 --> 00:39:55.309
General!

00:39:56.351 --> 00:40:01.273
Forgive me, but I have
to kill all the Japanese.

00:40:01.481 --> 00:40:03.984
Now then, all Britannians!

00:40:04.192 --> 00:40:06.653
Orders from the sub-viceroy! Kill the Elevens!

00:40:06.862 --> 00:40:09.239
All troops, exterminate the Elevens!

00:40:09.448 --> 00:40:13.035
Have you sealed the exits?
Don't let even one escape! Kill them all!

00:40:13.243 --> 00:40:14.953
Stop it! What are you doing?!

00:40:15.162 --> 00:40:17.915
This is Suzaku Kururugi,
Knight of Honor of the Britannian Forces!

00:40:18.123 --> 00:40:19.958
Cease fire at once!

00:40:21.293 --> 00:40:23.962
We were ordered
to kill all the Japanese here.

00:40:24.171 --> 00:40:25.672
Princess Euphemia ordered it personally.

00:40:25.881 --> 00:40:27.966
What? Princess Euphemia did?

00:40:28.175 --> 00:40:29.384
Don't be ridiculous!

00:40:29.593 --> 00:40:31.929
You're Japanese too, aren't you?

00:40:33.805 --> 00:40:35.724
--Wh-What's happening?!
--What happened in there?!

00:40:35.933 --> 00:40:37.476
--Gunfire?
--It can't be. What does the TV say?

00:40:37.684 --> 00:40:39.603
They cut the feed!

00:40:39.811 --> 00:40:41.897
Euphy, stop!

00:40:45.067 --> 00:40:47.069
This... My Geass did this?!

00:40:47.277 --> 00:40:49.279
Z-Zero...

00:40:49.488 --> 00:40:52.741
Japan's... savior...

00:40:52.950 --> 00:40:54.159
Stop it...

00:40:54.368 --> 00:40:58.413
I'm not your savior. I'm not your messiah!

00:40:58.622 --> 00:41:03.585
You're... You're our only... hope...

00:41:03.794 --> 00:41:05.128
Stop...

00:41:05.337 --> 00:41:08.215
Don't... Don't lay this on me...

00:41:08.423 --> 00:41:09.967
| have to atone for this sin?

00:41:10.175 --> 00:41:14.179
Bear this cross, too?! Me?!

00:41:14.388 --> 00:41:19.226
Zero... What did you
do to Princess Euphemia?!

00:41:19.434 --> 00:41:24.606
Andreas Darlton...
The closest of Cornelia's close advisors.

00:41:24.815 --> 00:41:26.858
What?! What's happening in the stadium?!

00:41:27.067 --> 00:41:28.485
We're figuring that out now!

00:41:28.694 --> 00:41:32.072
The... feed from the stadium... breaking up...

00:41:32.280 --> 00:41:33.573
Why can't you switch this off?!

00:41:33.782 --> 00:41:35.534
We're being hacked into from somewhere.

00:41:35.742 --> 00:41:38.370
Stop them! This is going
live to the entire world!

00:41:38.578 --> 00:41:42.916
They'll cut the broadcast soon.
Upload the data to the Net.

00:41:43.125 --> 00:41:44.501
--You heard him!
--Right.

00:41:44.710 --> 00:41:47.879
Sir! C.C. has rendezvoused
with the supreme commander!

00:41:48.088 --> 00:41:51.008
Good! That's the last problem cleared.

00:41:51.216 --> 00:41:54.386
| don't know how you arranged this situation,

00:41:54.594 --> 00:41:58.056
but this scheme is beyond
what we planned, Zero.

00:41:58.265 --> 00:41:59.099
Damn...

00:42:01.768 --> 00:42:04.104
I'm shocked. I didn't think you'd go this far.

00:42:04.312 --> 00:42:04.938
It wasn't me.

00:42:05.147 --> 00:42:06.314
What?

00:42:06.523 --> 00:42:11.403
| didn't use my Geass.
Or rather, I didn't mean to use it!

00:42:11.611 --> 00:42:14.906
| see. Then, what I felt before was...

00:42:15.115 --> 00:42:17.534
| knew at least that
this power was dangerous,

00:42:17.743 --> 00:42:21.872
but I still made my contract
with you. And yet...!

00:42:25.542 --> 00:42:29.129
He did it! He really did it!

00:42:30.630 --> 00:42:32.841
Euphy!

00:42:33.050 --> 00:42:35.093
Have you found her?! Where is she?!

00:42:35.302 --> 00:42:39.181
| don't know! We can't
contact Gen. Darlton, either!

00:42:39.389 --> 00:42:43.351
Something's wrong.
This isn't like Euphemia at all.

00:42:43.560 --> 00:42:45.353
| wish there was room to negotiate with this,

00:42:45.562 --> 00:42:46.897
but we can't reach Kirihara now!

00:42:47.105 --> 00:42:49.274
Hm, yes. For now,
we need to save ourselves.

00:42:49.483 --> 00:42:51.401
Indeed. Is the "souvenir" ready?

00:42:51.610 --> 00:42:53.612
How pathetic...

00:42:53.820 --> 00:42:56.073
In the end, we value ourselves above others.

00:42:56.281 --> 00:42:58.575
You shouldn't say that, Lady Sumeragi.

00:42:58.784 --> 00:43:01.203
We need to stay alive for Japan's sake, as well.

00:43:01.411 --> 00:43:03.538
And what's the point
if we're the only ones left?!

00:43:03.747 --> 00:43:06.333
Watch your tongue, Kaguyal!
You only have your family's name backing you!

00:43:06.541 --> 00:43:09.252
If we don't act now,
what's the point of Kyoto's existence?!

00:43:20.347 --> 00:43:23.266
Hey! The Britannian forces
have left the stadium!

00:43:23.475 --> 00:43:28.021
Right. In this case, our only option
is to exploit Euphemia to the utmost.

00:43:28.230 --> 00:43:30.607
It's the least we can do!

00:43:32.442 --> 00:43:35.487
Attention, Zero! Return that unit!

00:43:35.695 --> 00:43:37.948
That machine is the
property of our military...

00:43:38.156 --> 00:43:40.325
Calling all Black Knights!

00:43:40.534 --> 00:43:42.202
Euphemia has become our enemy!

00:43:42.410 --> 00:43:46.665
The specially administrated zone of
Nippon is a cowardly trap to lure us in!

00:43:46.873 --> 00:43:50.752
Armored autonomous battle knight units,
break into the ceremony grounds!

00:43:50.961 --> 00:43:55.215
Wipe out all Britannian forces!
Save the Japanese!

00:43:55.423 --> 00:43:56.967
Hurry!

00:43:59.344 --> 00:44:01.763
| have to... I have to find Euphy!

00:44:01.972 --> 00:44:04.724
Find her and kill her!

00:44:08.228 --> 00:44:11.898
How dare that Euphemia?!
How dare she trick us like this?!

00:44:15.026 --> 00:44:16.194
Elevens!

00:44:16.403 --> 00:44:17.487
That's right...

00:44:17.696 --> 00:44:20.323
| knew this was your real intention!

00:44:23.160 --> 00:44:24.452
It's the Black Knights!

00:44:24.661 --> 00:44:26.621
Smash the Britannians!

00:44:28.832 --> 00:44:33.253
Where is she?! Where's Euphy?!

00:44:33.461 --> 00:44:36.965
Stop it! I don't have
time to waste with you!

00:44:37.174 --> 00:44:39.926
My! This has become a real mess.

00:44:41.511 --> 00:44:44.014
Stop it!

00:44:44.222 --> 00:44:45.640
Are you Japanese?

00:44:45.849 --> 00:44:50.437
How rude of you!
| am Euphemia li Britannia!

00:44:50.645 --> 00:44:53.899
So, this is where you are, Princess!

00:44:54.107 --> 00:44:55.692
I'm going to avenge everyone, right here!

00:44:55.901 --> 00:44:57.444
Wait!

00:44:57.652 --> 00:44:59.988
I'll deal with her!

00:45:01.948 --> 00:45:04.451
A Japanese dares do this?!

00:45:10.207 --> 00:45:12.209
Now what, Zero? Do we take her prisoner?

00:45:12.417 --> 00:45:14.878
That's useless now.

00:45:15.086 --> 00:45:20.467
Kill them all! I must kill... all the Japanese!

00:45:26.389 --> 00:45:29.643
Why now?! Quickly! Quickly!

00:45:32.270 --> 00:45:34.856
Umm... I think it goes like this.

00:45:37.609 --> 00:45:40.528
Oh, I thought you were a Japanese.

00:45:40.737 --> 00:45:42.447
So, I was thinking,

00:45:42.656 --> 00:45:45.784
we can run the specially
administrated zone of Nippon together...

00:45:45.992 --> 00:45:47.869
Huh? Nippon?

00:45:48.078 --> 00:45:51.790
Yes. If it were possible,
| would have wanted to.

00:45:51.998 --> 00:45:53.792
You and |I.

00:45:57.671 --> 00:45:59.547
Euphy...

00:46:01.841 --> 00:46:02.884
Huh...?

00:46:04.344 --> 00:46:07.097
Lelouch... Why...?

00:46:07.305 --> 00:46:13.895
Farewell, Euphy. You may
have been the first girl I ever loved.

00:46:19.276 --> 00:46:20.318
Suzaku!

00:46:20.527 --> 00:46:22.195
Why now?!

00:46:27.867 --> 00:46:30.203
| can't let you kill my contract holder!

00:46:32.831 --> 00:46:36.209
--Suzaku!
--Out of my way!

00:46:42.090 --> 00:46:43.967
You...!

00:46:53.435 --> 00:46:58.523
Please... Save her! Save Euphy!

00:47:05.238 --> 00:47:07.240
At last, we meet!

00:47:07.449 --> 00:47:08.742
This girl...

00:47:08.950 --> 00:47:11.911
I'm sure she's a relative of Suzaku's.

00:47:12.120 --> 00:47:15.540
Zero, we want to make sure you'll be
working for us in what's to come...

00:47:15.749 --> 00:47:17.375
Just the opposite!

00:47:17.584 --> 00:47:22.047
From here on, you of the six houses
of Kyoto will be acting under my direction!

00:47:22.255 --> 00:47:24.049
| will allow no objections!

00:47:24.257 --> 00:47:28.845
Any other paths of survival
for you have now... vanished!

00:47:33.183 --> 00:47:34.642
We must inform Viceroy Cornelia.

00:47:34.851 --> 00:47:40.190
I'll be contacting her. Can she hold on
till we're back at the government bureau?

00:47:40.398 --> 00:47:41.858
She probably won't make it.

00:47:42.067 --> 00:47:45.403
I'll contact Prince Schneizel, then. Excuse me.

00:47:53.036 --> 00:47:54.996
Suzaku...

00:47:55.205 --> 00:47:56.664
Euphy!

00:48:09.552 --> 00:48:12.430
Euphy... I want you to tell me.

00:48:12.639 --> 00:48:15.725
Why did you give that order?

00:48:15.934 --> 00:48:20.897
Order? What are you talking about?

00:48:21.106 --> 00:48:26.820
Never mind that... Suzaku...
You're... Japanese, right?

00:48:27.028 --> 00:48:29.322
Huh? Yeah.

00:48:29.531 --> 00:48:30.115
Euphy!

00:48:30.323 --> 00:48:32.117
No!

00:48:32.325 --> 00:48:34.828
| mustn't... No...

00:48:35.036 --> 00:48:39.999
| mustn't... think such a thing...

00:48:40.208 --> 00:48:41.876
Suzaku?

00:48:42.085 --> 00:48:42.794
What?

00:48:43.002 --> 00:48:45.630
The ceremony...

00:48:45.839 --> 00:48:50.301
What has happened to Nippon?

00:48:50.510 --> 00:48:54.180
Euphy... You don't remember?

00:49:01.062 --> 00:49:06.609
People of Japan! All people
who are oppressed by Britannia!

00:49:06.818 --> 00:49:10.697
Did I make the people of Japan happy?

00:49:10.905 --> 00:49:12.699
--Never forgive Euphemia!
--Cowardly murderer!

00:49:12.907 --> 00:49:14.367
--Witch!
--Liar!

00:49:14.576 --> 00:49:15.493
Go to hell!

00:49:15.702 --> 00:49:20.123
That's right! Euphemia is
the symbol of Britannian hypocrisy!

00:49:20.331 --> 00:49:23.376
A murderer who cloaked
her crimes in the guise of the state!

00:49:23.585 --> 00:49:28.131
Did I... Did I make it work?

00:49:28.339 --> 00:49:31.759
Euphy... The special zone is...

00:49:35.013 --> 00:49:42.228
It's a huge success!
Everyone is so happy... in Nippon.

00:49:42.437 --> 00:49:43.980
Thank God...

00:49:44.189 --> 00:49:48.026
Here and now, I declare
our independence from Britannia!

00:49:48.234 --> 00:49:51.738
But don't take this to mean the
resurrection of the old nation of Japan!

00:49:51.946 --> 00:49:55.241
| won't make the mistake of trying
to wind back the clock of history!

00:49:55.450 --> 00:49:57.785
The new Japan we will now build

00:49:57.994 --> 00:50:01.498
shall be one broad enough to accept
all peoples, all histories, and all ideologies!

00:50:01.706 --> 00:50:05.418
A proud nation where the
strong shall not oppress the weak!

00:50:05.627 --> 00:50:09.339
And it shall be called...
the United States of Japan!

00:50:10.381 --> 00:50:13.676
Yes... This moment, a new nation is born!

00:50:13.885 --> 00:50:19.807
How... strange... I can't see...
your face... anymore...

00:50:27.232 --> 00:50:36.616
Keep going... to school...
| had... to stop... before I finished...

00:50:36.824 --> 00:50:38.910
Euphy... You can still go!

00:50:39.118 --> 00:50:42.413
| know! We can both go
to Ashford Academy together!

00:50:42.622 --> 00:50:47.544
Their student council is
so much fun...! You and I...!

00:50:47.752 --> 00:50:52.590
You'll have to... do it... in my place...

00:50:52.799 --> 00:50:56.094
No! Euphy, don't!

00:50:56.302 --> 00:51:01.349
Suzaku... I'm so glad... I met you...

00:51:13.027 --> 00:51:17.615
Area Fukushima,
Byakko squad, en route to lbaraki.

00:51:17.824 --> 00:51:19.617
Area Tama, barricade construction...

00:51:19.826 --> 00:51:22.453
You're planning to
assault the Tokyo Settlement?

00:51:22.662 --> 00:51:26.874
Right. This is the best chance we'll get.

00:51:27.083 --> 00:51:31.963
It's all right. Geass doesn't work on me.
You know that, don't you?

00:51:32.171 --> 00:51:34.424
That's true, isn't it?

00:51:34.632 --> 00:51:36.551
Now that I can't control my Geass,

00:51:36.759 --> 00:51:38.803
| suppose I can never see the others again.

00:51:39.012 --> 00:51:43.016
Have there been any other changes,
aside from losing control of your Geass?

00:51:43.224 --> 00:51:46.603
Not particularly. Just...

00:51:46.811 --> 00:51:52.567
Euphy... She resisted the Geass. My orders...

00:51:52.775 --> 00:51:55.153
| was wondering if my power had weakened...

00:51:55.361 --> 00:52:00.867
But I think it was... something
she couldn't permit herself to do.

00:52:01.075 --> 00:52:03.703
It was so against her nature...

00:52:03.911 --> 00:52:05.413
And so?

00:52:05.622 --> 00:52:08.207
That's all.

00:52:08.416 --> 00:52:10.335
It was just...

00:52:15.673 --> 00:52:20.511
| made my contract with you.
At the very least, I'll stay with you to the end.

00:52:24.807 --> 00:52:25.933
We were too slow.

00:52:26.142 --> 00:52:27.977
Even though we've cut off
the news being spread on the Net,

00:52:28.186 --> 00:52:31.147
insurrections have broken out
in all areas in just a few hours!

00:52:31.356 --> 00:52:32.523
The largest armed group, the Black Knights,

00:52:32.732 --> 00:52:37.278
is absorbing the masses and
advancing on the Tokyo Settlement!

00:52:37.487 --> 00:52:39.197
The other blocks have
deployed forces for defense

00:52:39.405 --> 00:52:40.740
and can't send reinforcements!

00:52:40.948 --> 00:52:44.118
Counting betrayals by honorary Britannians,

00:52:44.327 --> 00:52:45.995
the enemy's strength now reaches
into the tens of thousands!

00:52:46.204 --> 00:52:48.039
Sir Gilbert!

00:52:48.247 --> 00:52:50.583
| hope you're all right, Mr. Kaname.

00:52:50.792 --> 00:52:52.794
You said you had work in Shizuoka.

00:52:53.002 --> 00:52:55.505
Yeah, I'm fine over here.

00:52:55.713 --> 00:52:59.801
Look, Chigusa, we have something
important to discuss when I get back.

00:53:00.009 --> 00:53:01.594
Hm? What's up?

00:53:01.803 --> 00:53:04.263
That's the first time you've
ever called me by that name.

00:53:04.472 --> 00:53:06.599
Oh, you're right. Does it sound weird to you?

00:53:06.808 --> 00:53:11.688
Not a bit! Anyway, I'll be waiting.

00:53:11.896 --> 00:53:13.481
There she is! It's the Brit woman!

00:53:13.690 --> 00:53:15.024
| just saw her looking outside!

00:53:15.233 --> 00:53:18.277
A spy! You're a spy, aren't you?!

00:53:21.948 --> 00:53:23.950
Nina, go back to the school building floor!

00:53:24.158 --> 00:53:26.494
The insurgents are approaching Tokyo!

00:53:26.703 --> 00:53:29.038
| know. Zero's coming, isn't he?

00:53:29.247 --> 00:53:30.289
Huh?

00:53:30.498 --> 00:53:36.629
Just you wait, Princess Euphemia.
| swear, I'll avenge youl!

00:53:37.588 --> 00:53:41.092
Euphy... I just don't understand.

00:53:41.300 --> 00:53:43.553
Why did you give that order?!

00:53:43.761 --> 00:53:45.680
Shall I tell you?

00:53:45.888 --> 00:53:48.141
Huh? Who are you?

00:53:48.349 --> 00:53:53.980
How do you do, Suzaku Kururugi?
My name is V.V.

00:53:54.188 --> 00:53:55.898
V.V.?

00:53:56.107 --> 00:53:58.484
If we can just kill Cornelia, then we win!

00:53:58.693 --> 00:54:02.947
All forces, follow the
deployment scheme and stand by!

00:54:03.156 --> 00:54:05.616
Diethard, have Tohdoh handle the front line.

00:54:05.825 --> 00:54:07.243
I'm leaving you in charge here.

00:54:07.452 --> 00:54:08.953
Understood, sir.

00:54:09.162 --> 00:54:11.164
Hmm? You're Sumeragi's...?

00:54:11.372 --> 00:54:13.541
Oh, thank goodness! I'm in time!

00:54:13.750 --> 00:54:14.542
That was so mean of you,

00:54:14.751 --> 00:54:17.712
going into battle and
then leaving me behind like that!

00:54:17.920 --> 00:54:21.591
I've been a fan of yours for
a while now, ever since your debut!

00:54:21.799 --> 00:54:24.469
| was hoping we could finally
have a chance to talk, but...

00:54:24.677 --> 00:54:26.846
You're much taller than most people, huh?

00:54:27.054 --> 00:54:29.640
Don't worry, I'll catch up with you soon.

00:54:29.849 --> 00:54:31.267
L-Lady Kaguya,

00:54:31.476 --> 00:54:34.353
| thought the heads of the
Six Houses were staying back at Fuji.

00:54:34.562 --> 00:54:38.274
| caught up with you!
To see how my future husband fights!

00:54:38.483 --> 00:54:39.066
--Huh?
--Huh?

00:54:39.275 --> 00:54:40.526
Please don't joke.

00:54:40.735 --> 00:54:44.655
When you win this battle,
you'll eventually need a wife, right?

00:54:44.864 --> 00:54:47.366
If you're never going
to show your face to anyone,

00:54:47.575 --> 00:54:50.286
| think you're going to need
someone to compensate for that.

00:54:50.495 --> 00:54:53.372
You think we're going to win this battle?

00:54:53.581 --> 00:54:56.584
Yes! Because I'm the goddess of victory!

00:54:56.793 --> 00:55:02.590
How splendid! Unfortunately,
I've already made a contract with the devil.

00:55:02.799 --> 00:55:04.300
Huh?

00:55:04.509 --> 00:55:07.345
I'm afraid I can't be friendly
with any gods now.

00:55:12.308 --> 00:55:15.353
Hurry! We have to get the
experimental bio form back to the homeland!

00:55:15.561 --> 00:55:17.396
Ah! The pressure!

00:55:17.605 --> 00:55:19.941
The internal pressure is rising!

00:55:25.029 --> 00:55:27.573
N-Now, of all times...!

00:55:33.329 --> 00:55:35.581
Good morning, sir.

00:55:39.168 --> 00:55:41.045
Gen. Darlton, please!
You're in no condition to do this!

00:55:41.254 --> 00:55:45.508
| don't care! Her Highness...
| must get to Her Highness!

00:55:47.301 --> 00:55:49.846
Code-R... I see.

00:55:50.054 --> 00:55:51.472
You've given me an abnormal level

00:55:51.681 --> 00:55:53.933
of active electrical potential
and neurofilaments.

00:55:54.141 --> 00:55:55.810
It's such a pleasure to understand!

00:55:56.018 --> 00:55:59.438
You experimented on me
in order to recreate it, didn't you?

00:55:59.647 --> 00:56:00.731
This disease of hers...

00:56:00.940 --> 00:56:05.194
Code-R isn't an invalid!
In any case, won't you please calm down?

00:56:05.403 --> 00:56:07.697
Your brain cells were severed
from the Circle of Willis, so...

00:56:07.905 --> 00:56:11.367
Spare me your excuses!
You made me like this because you hated me

00:56:11.576 --> 00:56:13.369
for sending you back to the homeland!

00:56:13.578 --> 00:56:17.748
All right, I promise to hear you out,
but let's get back to the homeland first!

00:56:17.957 --> 00:56:20.585
We can't have a proper
conversation in this situation!

00:56:20.793 --> 00:56:22.837
Hear me, Britannia!

00:56:23.045 --> 00:56:23.963
My name is Zero.

00:56:24.171 --> 00:56:27.800
--Zero!
--I am a rebel against those with power!

00:56:28.009 --> 00:56:31.512
I will wait until 0:00!
Yield and surrender yourselves!

00:56:31.721 --> 00:56:32.763
The entire settlement?

00:56:32.972 --> 00:56:34.891
Yes, sir. He's on all
the communication channels.

00:56:35.099 --> 00:56:37.184
Then there's no way to contact the outside!

00:56:37.393 --> 00:56:40.980
Hmph... Use this chance
to confirm the enemy's formation.

00:56:41.188 --> 00:56:43.190
Yes, Your Highness.

00:56:43.399 --> 00:56:45.359
| will have vengeance for Euphemia,

00:56:45.568 --> 00:56:47.862
and I'll take it right here and now, Zero!

00:56:48.070 --> 00:56:51.657
Fair, open, and face to face!

00:56:51.866 --> 00:56:53.868
This is your final warning!

00:56:54.076 --> 00:56:57.914
I will wait until 0:00. Surrender yourselves!

00:56:58.122 --> 00:56:59.874
Surrender...

00:57:00.082 --> 00:57:02.126
The settlement... at 0:00...

00:57:02.335 --> 00:57:04.629
H-Hey! What are you doing?!

00:57:04.837 --> 00:57:06.464
Stop it! If you do that...!

00:57:06.672 --> 00:57:08.007
Would you please not interfere?

00:57:08.215 --> 00:57:11.719
This is no time to be kidding around!
If you don't stop...

00:57:18.726 --> 00:57:19.769
Are you ready to commence bombing?

00:57:19.977 --> 00:57:21.145
Timed on target.

00:57:21.354 --> 00:57:22.396
Good.

00:57:22.605 --> 00:57:24.523
Prepare to fire!

00:57:35.701 --> 00:57:37.036
What?!

00:57:40.331 --> 00:57:42.083
A-An earthquake?!

00:57:48.005 --> 00:57:50.716
A layered structure,
built to be earthquake resistant.

00:57:50.925 --> 00:57:54.011
But if you purge all of the
floor sections simultaneously,

00:57:54.220 --> 00:57:56.347
there's nothing more fragile!

00:57:56.555 --> 00:57:59.308
By gathering on the city's perimeter
to engage the Black Knights,

00:57:59.517 --> 00:58:01.227
you sealed your fate!

00:58:01.435 --> 00:58:03.813
I'm not beaten yet!

00:58:07.024 --> 00:58:09.944
Zero... You really are amazing!

00:58:13.280 --> 00:58:16.033
Whoa! Is the entire settlement collapsing?

00:58:16.242 --> 00:58:18.369
| heard it was just the outer perimeter.

00:58:18.577 --> 00:58:21.706
There are facilities in it we'll need later.

00:58:21.914 --> 00:58:25.668
Still, how did Zero's
underground collaborators do this?

00:58:25.876 --> 00:58:30.256
Was it that man who
neglected Zero's invitation?

00:58:30.464 --> 00:58:32.216
If so, this is magnificent!

00:58:32.425 --> 00:58:36.303
They will be sure to
establish a new world for us.

00:58:38.014 --> 00:58:38.973
This will do.

00:58:39.181 --> 00:58:41.434
Once we broadcast images of
the government bureau falling to us

00:58:41.642 --> 00:58:44.603
and our declaration of
independence to the world,

00:58:44.812 --> 00:58:47.064
then he'll have to face me,
whether he likes it or not!

00:58:47.273 --> 00:58:51.485
And if I can get him... get the Britannian
emperor to meet me face to face,

00:58:51.694 --> 00:58:55.406
then with my Geass, all the cards will fold!

00:58:57.450 --> 00:58:58.951
Zero Squad and the special forces squad,

00:58:59.160 --> 00:59:01.162
your priority is to take control
of the school grounds.

00:59:01.370 --> 00:59:03.247
We'll set up our command center
in one of the buildings.

00:59:03.456 --> 00:59:05.124
What? On the school grounds?

00:59:05.332 --> 00:59:08.044
Ohgi, you stand by there as well.

00:59:08.252 --> 00:59:08.961
Ohgi!

00:59:09.170 --> 00:59:12.006
R-Right. Understood.

00:59:23.434 --> 00:59:25.895
Diethard! Their air power
has been taken care of!

00:59:26.103 --> 00:59:29.023
Leave G1 to Kaguya.
Move to your assigned location!

00:59:29.231 --> 00:59:30.149
Understood.

00:59:30.357 --> 00:59:31.567
Yoshida, prepare the Raikou!

00:59:31.776 --> 00:59:32.318
Right!

00:59:32.526 --> 00:59:34.028
Tamaki, where's Rakshata?

00:59:34.236 --> 00:59:35.321
On the move.

00:59:35.529 --> 00:59:36.947
Kallen, move to back them up!

00:59:37.156 --> 00:59:37.573
Right!

00:59:37.782 --> 00:59:39.742
Tohdoh, if the target appears...

00:59:39.950 --> 00:59:40.951
Understood.

00:59:41.160 --> 00:59:43.913
All right... Ohgi, what's
the collaborator's name?

00:59:44.121 --> 00:59:47.374
R-Right. I have it as Sayoko Shinozaki.

00:59:47.750 --> 00:59:48.584
"Britannian Homeland -
Court Conference Room"

00:59:48.584 --> 00:59:50.211
"Britannian Homeland - Court Conference
Room" Contact lost with Hiroshima Settlement.

00:59:50.211 --> 00:59:50.419
"Britannian Homeland -
Court Conference Room"

00:59:50.419 --> 00:59:52.505
"Britannian Homeland - Court Conference Room™ Uprisings have
apparently broken out in the Sapporo Settlement as well!

00:59:52.505 --> 00:59:52.630
"Britannian Homeland -
Court Conference Room"

00:59:52.713 --> 00:59:54.632
We confirm that Chinese
Federation naval forces

00:59:54.840 --> 00:59:56.592
are massing in the East China Sea!

00:59:56.801 --> 00:59:58.844
The Chinese Federation, too?!

00:59:59.053 --> 01:00:02.348
That's all we need,
with His Majesty still not here!

01:00:04.016 --> 01:00:07.103
Prince Odysseus,
we're ready to deploy troops.

01:00:07.311 --> 01:00:09.313
Please assign the commanders.

01:00:09.522 --> 01:00:15.152
Let's not be too hasty. What Princess
Euphemia did was clearly a failure.

01:00:15.361 --> 01:00:17.780
If we deal with this incorrectly,
this may spread to every Areal!

01:00:17.988 --> 01:00:20.116
Your Highness!
We must help Princess Cornelia--

01:00:20.324 --> 01:00:22.785
Brother, why don't I go there?

01:00:22.993 --> 01:00:25.329
Y-You will?! You'll go there?!

01:00:25.538 --> 01:00:28.874
Don't you find it sad to see
those people killing each other?

01:00:29.083 --> 01:00:31.335
Freeze! We're the Black Knights!

01:00:31.544 --> 01:00:33.379
We've occupied this building!

01:00:33.587 --> 01:00:35.047
You will do as we tell you to!

01:00:35.256 --> 01:00:37.091
N-No... It can't be!

01:00:37.299 --> 01:00:40.261
Now then, shall we transmit this to the world?

01:00:40.469 --> 01:00:44.682
The moment that Zero
changes everything. Chief?

01:00:44.890 --> 01:00:45.683
Y-Yes?

01:00:45.891 --> 01:00:51.772
We're going to give the public
the greatest show they ever hoped to see!

01:00:51.981 --> 01:00:54.900
That makes it every broadcasting station!

01:00:56.402 --> 01:00:58.195
Hands up and turn around!

01:00:58.404 --> 01:01:01.407
The Black Knights
have now taken this school!

01:01:01.615 --> 01:01:02.741
Lower the guns!

01:01:02.950 --> 01:01:06.829
Huh? That's a hell of a thing
to say in this situation!

01:01:07.037 --> 01:01:07.454
Rivalz!

01:01:07.663 --> 01:01:09.874
Lemme be cool for once!

01:01:10.082 --> 01:01:11.625
I'm protecting everyone here!

01:01:11.834 --> 01:01:13.169
Oh, is that a fact?!

01:01:13.377 --> 01:01:15.754
Stop!

01:01:15.963 --> 01:01:18.674
| told you to avoid violence!

01:01:18.883 --> 01:01:21.760
But you told us this was
gonna be our command center!

01:01:21.969 --> 01:01:23.262
Command center?!

01:01:23.470 --> 01:01:26.098
| guarantee you will be unharmed.

01:01:28.142 --> 01:01:33.022
Like we can believe you?!
You guys are at war with us Britannians!

01:01:33.230 --> 01:01:34.857
Rivalz, please.

01:01:35.065 --> 01:01:36.901
Do what he says.

01:01:38.360 --> 01:01:39.653
Kallen!

01:01:43.490 --> 01:01:47.453
Which means that Lulu is
also one of the Black Knights?

01:01:47.661 --> 01:01:51.165
The government bureau.
Once you take down the Britannian bureau,

01:01:51.373 --> 01:01:54.293
the Chinese Federation
can back you up as planned.

01:01:54.501 --> 01:01:56.337
So says High Eunuch Gao.

01:01:58.005 --> 01:02:00.466
That will be a huge help! Please do!

01:02:02.593 --> 01:02:04.803
Out of my way!

01:02:24.031 --> 01:02:27.243
Where is Zero?! I'll kill him!

01:02:28.619 --> 01:02:29.453
Geass?

01:02:29.662 --> 01:02:32.623
Correct. Zero possesses
a supernatural power.

01:02:32.831 --> 01:02:34.124
Impossible.

01:02:34.333 --> 01:02:37.878
Then why did Princess Euphemia
suddenly change so completely?

01:02:38.087 --> 01:02:40.673
And what about you,
the one who always follows the rules?

01:02:40.881 --> 01:02:44.385
What about what you did
on Shikine Island? In short...

01:02:44.593 --> 01:02:48.430
The power to control people
and erase their memory!

01:02:48.639 --> 01:02:49.390
When you think about it,

01:02:49.598 --> 01:02:53.143
it coherently explains
everything that's happened till now.

01:02:53.352 --> 01:02:58.107
And in its aftereffects,
| fell in love with a damned Eleven!

01:02:58.315 --> 01:03:01.694
That student is the root of all this evil!

01:03:06.407 --> 01:03:07.950
--Suzaku!
--Kallen?!

01:03:08.158 --> 01:03:11.912
We meet in battle again. I'm sorry,
but this time, you're going to die!

01:03:12.121 --> 01:03:16.166
You're all fools! You, the Japanese,
everyone being tricked by that man!

01:03:16.375 --> 01:03:20.504
| can't stand that kind of talk!
What do you even know about Zero?!

01:03:20.713 --> 01:03:23.299
Then tell me what you know about him!

01:03:23.507 --> 01:03:26.051
Tell me where Zero is now!

01:03:35.894 --> 01:03:38.188
Come on, answer me! Where is Zero?!

01:03:38.397 --> 01:03:40.482
| won't tell a traitor like you!

01:03:40.691 --> 01:03:42.568
Then let's finish this here!

01:03:42.776 --> 01:03:45.696
Don't get so full of yourself,
just because you can fly!

01:03:49.700 --> 01:03:50.784
I've got you!

01:03:50.993 --> 01:03:53.162
Eat this!

01:04:05.215 --> 01:04:07.426
Now tell me! Where is Zero?!

01:04:07.634 --> 01:04:10.095
| hate pushy guys, you know.

01:04:10.304 --> 01:04:13.098
| see. Then die here.

01:04:15.059 --> 01:04:17.269
Any last words?

01:04:17.478 --> 01:04:19.021
Wait!

01:04:21.231 --> 01:04:22.649
Suzaku Kururugi,

01:04:22.858 --> 01:04:26.111
it seems my attachment toward you
was wishful thinking on my part.

01:04:26.320 --> 01:04:29.990
I'd like to settle this one-on-one
to make up for my mistake.

01:04:30.199 --> 01:04:32.076
Fine with me!

01:04:32.284 --> 01:04:34.119
Order Lord Crane to fall back.

01:04:34.328 --> 01:04:36.288
Set up a defense line on
the railway station grounds.

01:04:36.497 --> 01:04:38.082
Yes, Your Highness.

01:04:38.290 --> 01:04:39.917
Princess Cornelia,

01:04:40.125 --> 01:04:42.920
I've reached our encampment.
What about the bureau's defense line?

01:04:43.128 --> 01:04:46.173
Hold your position. If we drag this battle out,

01:04:46.382 --> 01:04:48.175
it'll work against the Black Knights.

01:04:48.384 --> 01:04:49.802
Yes, Your Highness.

01:04:50.010 --> 01:04:52.054
Well, what does my older brother say?

01:04:52.262 --> 01:04:55.599
He says the Pacific fleet
should arrive in 45 hours.

01:04:55.808 --> 01:04:56.892
Also, within Area 11,

01:04:57.101 --> 01:05:00.312
the Sado and Torishima air
divisions have already been deployed.

01:05:00.521 --> 01:05:03.649
Meaning they should
be here in about 30 minutes.

01:05:03.857 --> 01:05:07.152
Leak that information to the Black Knights!

01:05:07.361 --> 01:05:11.407
After the leak, you will defend
the bureau's front line with Sir Gilbert.

01:05:11.615 --> 01:05:13.367
And you, Princess Cornelia?

01:05:13.575 --> 01:05:15.577
I'll be preparing the party.

01:05:15.786 --> 01:05:17.746
Zero!!

01:05:17.955 --> 01:05:18.997
Can't you calm him down?!

01:05:19.206 --> 01:05:20.416
His resistance is too strong!

01:05:20.624 --> 01:05:22.584
I'm mounting the radiator fins!

01:05:26.338 --> 01:05:28.424
T4's headed for the government bureau?

01:05:28.632 --> 01:05:30.551
Are the enemy air divisions here already?

01:05:30.759 --> 01:05:32.553
No, just one unit so far.

01:05:32.761 --> 01:05:35.097
Then it shouldn't affect too many of us.

01:05:35.305 --> 01:05:39.476
We're holding the school and Diethard's
group is holding the media areas.

01:05:39.685 --> 01:05:42.062
Lady Kaguya is standing by on the rear line.

01:05:42.271 --> 01:05:45.774
All we need is to push in
on their rear line and we've won.

01:05:45.983 --> 01:05:48.360
We need this--for Yoshida
and the others who died.

01:05:48.569 --> 01:05:50.988
Sub-commander, we've captured a stranger.

01:05:51.196 --> 01:05:55.742
A student? Then let them go.
We have no reason to hold them.

01:05:55.951 --> 01:05:58.954
No, they were caught
sneaking in through the rear gate.

01:05:59.163 --> 01:06:00.664
Sneaking in?

01:06:03.792 --> 01:06:05.627
Chigusa!

01:06:05.836 --> 01:06:08.881
Sh-She's a collaborator
who reports directly to me.

01:06:09.089 --> 01:06:12.551
Take us to another classroom.
I'll hear her report directly there.

01:06:12.759 --> 01:06:15.679
| wonder if Nina's still
in the Ganymede hangar.

01:06:15.888 --> 01:06:20.809
And Kallen's part of this?
Oh... What are we going to do?

01:06:21.018 --> 01:06:21.643
It's all right.

01:06:21.852 --> 01:06:22.644
--Hmm?
--Huh?

01:06:22.853 --> 01:06:24.563
The Black Knights--

01:06:24.771 --> 01:06:29.485
Or rather, Zero--absolutely
won't do anything to harm us.

01:06:29.693 --> 01:06:31.153
How can you be so sure?

01:06:31.361 --> 01:06:33.197
Coward!

01:06:34.865 --> 01:06:36.241
Huh?!

01:06:38.285 --> 01:06:41.705
You've taken hostages?!
Some one-on-one fight this is!

01:06:41.914 --> 01:06:45.334
Unfortunately, I don't have the
same set of aesthetics that you do.

01:06:45.542 --> 01:06:49.505
Now, surrender, Sir Suzaku.

01:06:49.713 --> 01:06:53.091
Hey, that black Knightmare's
the one that was on the news, right?

01:06:53.300 --> 01:06:57.346
It can't be... Zero's targeting
this building?! He can't be!

01:06:57.554 --> 01:07:00.557
He can't! Because, if he does...!

01:07:00.766 --> 01:07:02.768
If I can get at his chest and use the harkens...

01:07:02.976 --> 01:07:05.312
Zero!!

01:07:07.856 --> 01:07:10.108
Go!

01:07:10.317 --> 01:07:12.361
Wha...?! Why, you...!

01:07:17.115 --> 01:07:21.286
| figured they didn't have time
to come up with a countermeasure for this.

01:07:21.495 --> 01:07:23.413
Zero, as promised.

01:07:23.622 --> 01:07:25.916
Yes. You can do with
the machine as you wish.

01:07:26.124 --> 01:07:30.504
Zero! You trick people to the very end!
You betray them!

01:07:30.712 --> 01:07:34.633
Hmph! I have no time to argue
who's the bigger hypocrite here.

01:07:34.841 --> 01:07:37.219
Farewell, Suzaku Kururugi.

01:07:37.427 --> 01:07:39.388
Damn it all!

01:07:39.596 --> 01:07:41.890
Tohdoh, I'm going to move
in on the bureau from above.

01:07:42.099 --> 01:07:45.143
Hm? Isn't it risky to rely
on the abilities of that machine?

01:07:45.352 --> 01:07:48.814
I'm just going to hit their backup forces.
I'm not getting in too deep.

01:07:50.691 --> 01:07:51.733
It looks like...

01:07:51.942 --> 01:07:54.695
Yes. Aries Villa.

01:07:54.903 --> 01:07:56.196
How do you know that?!

01:07:56.405 --> 01:08:00.284
I'll tell you someday, when the time comes.

01:08:01.702 --> 01:08:03.787
Welcome, Zero.

01:08:03.996 --> 01:08:08.041
| figured you'd come here
if you knew about the air raid.

01:08:08.250 --> 01:08:12.087
Now, come to your welcome party!

01:08:12.296 --> 01:08:15.591
Do you fancy a dance?

01:08:15.799 --> 01:08:19.219
Chigusa, why did you
come to this battlefield?!

01:08:19.428 --> 01:08:21.305
We need to find you some place safe.

01:08:21.513 --> 01:08:24.016
For now, stay with me...

01:08:26.435 --> 01:08:29.187
Look... I'm sorry I hid this from you.

01:08:29.396 --> 01:08:32.190
But I'm doing this for the sake of peace!

01:08:32.399 --> 01:08:36.653
If Zero can free Japan from Britannia,
we can be together!

01:08:36.862 --> 01:08:39.114
Oh, stop before I puke!

01:08:41.533 --> 01:08:46.413
Me, and an Eleven like you, together?

01:08:46.622 --> 01:08:49.666
My name is Villetta Nu,
Knight of Honor of Britannia!

01:08:49.875 --> 01:08:51.209
B-But...

01:08:54.254 --> 01:08:59.509
S-So, Chigusa... You got your memory back...

01:09:03.639 --> 01:09:04.890
Ohgi's been shot?!

01:09:05.098 --> 01:09:06.975
Yeah. The medic's taking care of him now.

01:09:07.184 --> 01:09:08.560
And it was the woman who shot him?!

01:09:08.769 --> 01:09:10.896
We're still not sure.
We're searching for her now!

01:09:11.104 --> 01:09:11.647
Wait!

01:09:11.855 --> 01:09:13.065
Huh?

01:09:13.273 --> 01:09:16.443
Don't tell anyone else about Ohgi.
It'll only shake them up.

01:09:16.652 --> 01:09:17.861
Just find the girl!

01:09:18.070 --> 01:09:19.363
Gotcha!

01:09:19.571 --> 01:09:22.199
This is for Euphy!

01:09:25.118 --> 01:09:27.287
What's wrong, Zero?!

01:09:30.999 --> 01:09:33.627
| thought the specs on
this thing were overwhelming!

01:09:36.463 --> 01:09:39.216
Weakling!

01:09:39.424 --> 01:09:46.306
| have you! Your life is now in my hands!

01:09:46.515 --> 01:09:47.265
Cornelia!

01:09:47.474 --> 01:09:50.102
This is your judgment!

01:09:54.064 --> 01:09:57.776
Princess, it's me, Darlton.

01:09:57.984 --> 01:10:00.195
Wha...? But, why?

01:10:00.404 --> 01:10:04.533
Have no fear. I will not kill you.

01:10:04.741 --> 01:10:05.784
He made it.

01:10:05.992 --> 01:10:09.204
I'm doing this to deliver
you to Zero, Your Highness.

01:10:14.960 --> 01:10:16.920
Princess!

01:10:18.505 --> 01:10:20.882
Thank you, Darlton.

01:10:22.676 --> 01:10:26.263
Princess!!

01:10:32.185 --> 01:10:36.022
Hm? Is that you, C.C.?

01:10:36.231 --> 01:10:37.232
No.

01:10:37.441 --> 01:10:39.735
Hm? But...

01:10:39.943 --> 01:10:43.572
Nunnally... I've come for you.

01:10:45.240 --> 01:10:50.078
| see... You were Zero all along.

01:10:50.871 --> 01:10:54.249
Someone with a grudge against
the Britannian imperial family...

01:10:54.458 --> 01:10:58.670
Darlton's analysis was correct.

01:10:58.879 --> 01:11:02.466
Y-You did this all for Nunnally's sake?

01:11:02.674 --> 01:11:04.342
Correct.

01:11:04.551 --> 01:11:08.346
| will destroy the present world
and build a new one in its place.

01:11:08.555 --> 01:11:11.725
You killed them for
the sake of that madness?!

01:11:11.933 --> 01:11:14.770
Clovis? Even Euphy?!

01:11:14.978 --> 01:11:16.188
You're one to talk, sister,

01:11:16.396 --> 01:11:20.233
considering how you idolized
my mother, Marianne the Flash.

01:11:21.443 --> 01:11:26.323
It would seem... Any further talk
with you would be useless.

01:11:26.531 --> 01:11:30.035
Hmph! Lelouch vi Britannia
orders you to answer him!

01:11:36.166 --> 01:11:37.417
Right.

01:11:37.626 --> 01:11:40.212
Sister, were you the one
who killed my mother?

01:11:40.420 --> 01:11:41.338
No.

01:11:41.546 --> 01:11:42.964
Then who was it?

01:11:43.173 --> 01:11:45.675
| don't know.

01:11:45.884 --> 01:11:48.178
You were in charge of
her personal guard, were you not?!

01:11:48.386 --> 01:11:49.304
Yes.

01:11:49.513 --> 01:11:51.932
Then why did you withdraw her escort?

01:11:52.140 --> 01:11:53.600
Because I was asked to.

01:11:53.809 --> 01:11:54.893
By whom?!

01:11:55.101 --> 01:11:57.103
Lady Marianne.

01:11:57.312 --> 01:12:00.524
Mother did?! That's impossible!

01:12:00.732 --> 01:12:04.444
Are you saying Mother knew
she would be attacked that day?!

01:12:04.653 --> 01:12:08.907
No, it's impossible! If she did,
she would have gotten us out of there!

01:12:09.115 --> 01:12:13.787
What happened on that day?!
Who killed my mother?!

01:12:18.333 --> 01:12:22.295
You don't know? Then who knows the truth?!

01:12:22.504 --> 01:12:25.715
| know you've investigated
what happened that day yourself!

01:12:25.924 --> 01:12:27.092
Hey! Get back in here!

01:12:27.300 --> 01:12:30.387
| know! The government bureau
defense forces will be here soon.

01:12:30.595 --> 01:12:33.932
No! Your little sister's been kidnapped!

01:12:34.140 --> 01:12:36.017
This is no time for jokes.

01:12:36.226 --> 01:12:38.478
Now we have to take Cornelia
to headquarters as our hostage.

01:12:38.687 --> 01:12:41.898
| just know this!
It's the reason you have for living!

01:12:42.107 --> 01:12:44.526
She's headed for Kamine Island!

01:12:44.734 --> 01:12:48.321
Kamine Island? The one near
Shikine Island, with the base?

01:12:50.782 --> 01:12:56.121
It's no use! This much Sakuradite
will never be enough! What do I do?

01:12:56.329 --> 01:12:59.708
| have to avenge Princess Euphemia's death!

01:13:13.346 --> 01:13:17.559
What are these ruins? Don't tell me
these have something to do with you.

01:13:17.767 --> 01:13:18.894
| don't know this place.

01:13:19.102 --> 01:13:21.938
Hmph, meaning there are others like it?

01:13:22.147 --> 01:13:24.316
Does the one who took
Nunnally have a Geass power?

01:13:24.524 --> 01:13:26.818
| don't know that much.

01:13:27.027 --> 01:13:28.445
It's the truth.

01:13:28.653 --> 01:13:29.821
I'll believe you.

01:13:30.030 --> 01:13:34.743
At the very least,
we're still partners in crime.

01:13:34.951 --> 01:13:36.661
Thank you.

01:13:42.876 --> 01:13:45.128
Search complete!

01:13:45.337 --> 01:13:47.213
Zero, now repent!

01:13:47.422 --> 01:13:48.840
Orange?!

01:13:49.049 --> 01:13:54.387
Unburden yourself! Confess your shame,
and unburden yourself of remorse!

01:13:56.556 --> 01:13:58.892
The point that Cornelia damaged before!

01:13:59.935 --> 01:14:02.979
The Hadron Cannon only has one shot left!

01:14:03.188 --> 01:14:06.483
My magnificent vengeance!

01:14:11.154 --> 01:14:13.114
Makeshift, one-shot, and impudent!

01:14:13.323 --> 01:14:15.992
Leave him to me! You go after Nunnally!

01:14:16.201 --> 01:14:17.619
But we're out of energy!

01:14:17.827 --> 01:14:19.329
I'll be okay!

01:14:21.206 --> 01:14:24.668
Actually, I'm a little nervous.

01:14:24.876 --> 01:14:31.007
Win, Lelouch. Over your own past.
And over the outcome of your actions.

01:14:36.513 --> 01:14:38.556
C.C., don't die!

01:14:38.765 --> 01:14:40.225
Who are you talking to?

01:14:40.433 --> 01:14:43.269
Hmph. You have a point.

01:14:45.105 --> 01:14:47.399
I've found youl!

01:14:47.607 --> 01:14:52.654
You are captured, Zero!
This is my pro-mode comeback!

01:14:55.323 --> 01:14:58.618
You're not who I'd choose
to commit suicide with, but...

01:15:06.292 --> 01:15:09.796
Hold the line! Victory is within sight!

01:15:10.005 --> 01:15:11.131
Where is Kozuki?!

01:15:11.339 --> 01:15:13.091
She went to help Zero
at the deputy commander's order!

01:15:13.299 --> 01:15:15.969
But we can't reach Zero!

01:15:17.721 --> 01:15:22.225
Inoue... Where the hell did you go, Zero?!

01:15:28.356 --> 01:15:33.403
What do I do? If whomever
kidnapped Nunnally has a Geass...

01:15:33.611 --> 01:15:37.741
In any case, first thing to do
is make sure Nunnally is all right.

01:15:43.538 --> 01:15:46.332
Turn and face me. Slowly.

01:15:46.541 --> 01:15:49.794
Suzaku? What's he doing here?!

01:15:50.003 --> 01:15:53.381
Didn't you hear me, Zero?

01:15:53.590 --> 01:15:57.886
Turn and face me. Slowly.

01:15:58.094 --> 01:16:02.140
Euphemia arbitrarily
murdered innocent Japanese people.

01:16:02.348 --> 01:16:03.141
You'd fight for a woman like--

01:16:03.349 --> 01:16:06.269
That Geass power of yours
is very convenient, isn't it?

01:16:06.478 --> 01:16:11.191
You get to hide in the shadows
while others take all the blame.

01:16:11.399 --> 01:16:16.237
An arrogant coward. That's your true nature.

01:16:16.446 --> 01:16:17.822
Kallen!

01:16:18.031 --> 01:16:21.284
Don't you want to know
Zero's true identity, too?

01:16:21.493 --> 01:16:22.660
Why are you asking me that now?

01:16:22.869 --> 01:16:24.954
You also have a right to bear witness.

01:16:25.163 --> 01:16:27.457
W-Wait!

01:16:55.693 --> 01:16:58.947
How? Why?!

01:17:05.745 --> 01:17:08.998
| didn't want to believe it.

01:17:09.207 --> 01:17:11.251
L-Lelouch is...?

01:17:11.459 --> 01:17:15.880
Yes, I'm Zero.
The man who leads the Black Knights,

01:17:16.089 --> 01:17:18.383
who challenges the Holy Britannian Empire,

01:17:18.591 --> 01:17:22.262
and who holds the entire world in his hand.

01:17:24.264 --> 01:17:29.060
You used us Japanese... You used me?!

01:17:29.269 --> 01:17:33.731
Japan will be freed as a result.
You've nothing to complain about, surely.

01:17:35.567 --> 01:17:37.944
| should have arrested you sooner.

01:17:38.153 --> 01:17:39.696
You realized it was me?

01:17:39.904 --> 01:17:43.908
