District” And the only one who knows about it is...

01:26:39.652 --> 01:26:39.860
"The Chinese Federation -
Indian Military District”

01:26:39.860 --> 01:26:41.320
"The Chinese Federation - Indian Military
District” Zero! I knew you were still alive!

01:26:41.320 --> 01:26:43.864
Zero! I knew you were still alive!

01:26:44.073 --> 01:26:44.532
Hear me, Britannia! Pay close attention,
all of you who have power!

01:26:44.532 --> 01:26:49.662
"Area 11 - Tokyo Settlement" Hear me, Britannia!
Pay close attention, all of you who have power!

01:26:49.662 --> 01:26:50.204
Hear me, Britannia! Pay close attention,
all of you who have power!

01:26:50.413 --> 01:26:52.498
| am sad.

01:26:52.707 --> 01:26:57.044
War and discrimination.
Evil intentions brandished by the strong.

01:26:57.253 --> 01:27:01.507
The same mistaken discharge
of tragedy and comedy.

01:27:01.716 --> 01:27:04.969
The world has not changed one bit!

01:27:05.177 --> 01:27:08.723
And that is why I had to reawaken!

01:27:08.931 --> 01:27:14.770
So long as the strong oppress
the weak, my rebellion will continue!

01:27:14.979 --> 01:27:17.773
Beginning with the divine punishment
| brought down just now

01:27:17.982 --> 01:27:20.776
upon the foolish Viceroy Calares!

01:27:20.943 --> 01:27:21.444
Man, oh man. The Elevens' king
sure popped back up with a vengeance.

01:27:21.444 --> 01:27:25.156
"Holy Britannian Empire - Capital, Pendragon™ Man, oh man.
The Elevens' king sure popped back up with a vengeance.

01:27:25.156 --> 01:27:25.364
"Holy Britannian Empire -
Capital, Pendragon”

01:27:25.364 --> 01:27:26.490
"Holy Britannian Empire -
Capital, Pendragon” Huh, Suzaku?

01:27:26.490 --> 01:27:27.324
Huh, Suzaku?

01:27:28.492 --> 01:27:31.704
Got it! The signal is originating
from the Chinese Federation consulate!

01:27:31.912 --> 01:27:32.997
The Chinese Federation's?

01:27:33.205 --> 01:27:34.623
It couldn't be.

01:27:36.667 --> 01:27:39.128
C'mon, Zero's dead, isn't he?

01:27:39.336 --> 01:27:39.920
Yeah.

01:27:40.129 --> 01:27:44.925
Then this is a fake? Either way,
if we break into the consulate...

01:27:45.134 --> 01:27:48.471
We'd be breaking a vital rule.
It'd cause an international incident.

01:27:48.679 --> 01:27:51.682
As long as he's calling himself Zero,
he's guilty of killing royalty.

01:27:51.891 --> 01:27:55.561
Not that our war with
the E.U. isn't important, but...

01:27:55.770 --> 01:27:58.230
It's a slippery slope, either way.

01:27:58.439 --> 01:27:59.857
| shall fight!

01:28:00.065 --> 01:28:03.986
Fight all those who use power mistakenly!

01:28:04.195 --> 01:28:05.404
Therefore...

01:28:05.613 --> 01:28:10.326
| declare here and now that
| will continue to implement justice!

01:28:14.288 --> 01:28:19.668
Zero! Zero! Zero! Zero!
Zero! Zero! Zero! Zero! Zero!

01:28:19.877 --> 01:28:21.253
Sir Bismarck...

01:28:21.462 --> 01:28:25.007
Whether this is the same person as
the Zero from a year ago is under review.

01:28:25.216 --> 01:28:28.052
Yes, and I should take
action now, to help verify that.

01:28:28.260 --> 01:28:30.805
You are rushing too fast to an answer.

01:28:31.013 --> 01:28:34.642
For now, wait for the classified
intelligence agency's report.

01:28:36.393 --> 01:28:39.480
For what reason are you
keeping the old Zero's identity

01:28:39.688 --> 01:28:42.942
and the Geass special ability a secret?

01:28:51.200 --> 01:28:53.035
God shall die!

01:28:53.244 --> 01:28:55.663
That is our contract.

01:28:57.039 --> 01:29:00.918
Tell me, Charles,
why did you not tell Nunnally?

01:29:01.126 --> 01:29:03.504
About Zero's true identity. And about Geass.

01:29:03.712 --> 01:29:06.757
It wasn't necessary for her to know.

01:29:06.966 --> 01:29:10.094
Charles... You're still such a child.

01:29:10.302 --> 01:29:13.764
| suppose I am... big brother.

01:29:16.392 --> 01:29:16.433
"Chinese Federation Capital -Luoyang-"

01:29:16.433 --> 01:29:18.644
"Chinese Federation Capital -Luoyang-"
How go things in Area 11?

01:29:18.644 --> 01:29:18.853
"Chinese Federation Capital -Luoyang-"

01:29:18.853 --> 01:29:21.230
"Chinese Federation Capital -Luoyang-" I'm
not sure. Even I don't know all the details.

01:29:21.230 --> 01:29:21.438
I'm not sure.
Even I don't know all the details.

01:29:21.647 --> 01:29:24.275
What goes on in the outside world?

01:29:24.483 --> 01:29:27.236
I've never set foot outside of this palace.

01:29:27.444 --> 01:29:30.656
Your Majesty, Luoyang... Indeed,
the Vermilion Forbidden City itself,

01:29:30.865 --> 01:29:32.491
is the center of the entire world!

01:29:32.700 --> 01:29:33.617
But...

01:29:33.826 --> 01:29:36.328
Well then, I shall go out
and see what is happening.

01:29:36.537 --> 01:29:37.454
Huh?

01:29:37.663 --> 01:29:40.875
The truth is, I came today to say goodbye.

01:29:41.083 --> 01:29:45.629
Oh, no! Not after
I've made my first friend in you!

01:29:45.838 --> 01:29:50.384
| beg your pardon,
but my husband is waiting for me.

01:29:52.052 --> 01:29:55.222
Yes. The reborn Zero's true objective...

01:29:55.431 --> 01:29:57.516
If it's here, that could mean trouble for us.

01:29:57.725 --> 01:30:01.145
Yes. Is that why you've
made arrangements for me?

01:30:01.353 --> 01:30:02.062
It is.

01:30:02.271 --> 01:30:04.440
Thank you very much.

01:30:04.648 --> 01:30:06.317
Huh? Are you sure?

01:30:06.525 --> 01:30:11.405
Yes. We've received word that you are
to be the next viceroy of Area 11.

01:30:11.614 --> 01:30:12.865
Then I have to tell my big brother.

01:30:13.073 --> 01:30:17.244
That cannot be allowed. Master Lelouch
is suffering from memory loss.

01:30:17.453 --> 01:30:21.415
If you were to meet with him,
it would only cause him confusion.

01:30:27.838 --> 01:30:31.550
No problems? Then who is that Zero?

01:30:39.934 --> 01:30:42.019
What exactly is going on?

01:30:42.227 --> 01:30:45.689
They say that Zero relocated to
the Chinese Federation after things ended.

01:30:48.192 --> 01:30:51.236
And yet Lelouch is still at Ashford.

01:30:51.445 --> 01:30:54.615
We sent in those two as support,
just to be safe.

01:30:54.823 --> 01:30:57.576
But I can't tell them
that Lelouch could be Zero.

01:31:08.754 --> 01:31:10.589
Good morning, Lelouch.

01:31:10.798 --> 01:31:12.633
Th-The Knight of Six!

01:31:12.841 --> 01:31:14.510
Hey there, we've been waiting for you!

01:31:14.718 --> 01:31:17.805
You're Vice-President Lamperouge, right?
We've been awaiting the honor of...

01:31:18.013 --> 01:31:18.931
Be more casual, will you?

01:31:19.139 --> 01:31:20.516
Oh, right.

01:31:20.724 --> 01:31:22.977
We've enrolled in this school.

01:31:23.185 --> 01:31:27.398
And we insist on our social status
being ignored while we're in school.

01:31:27.606 --> 01:31:30.067
They said they wanted the
experience of being ordinary students.

01:31:30.275 --> 01:31:33.320
Right now, we're teaching them how to speak.

01:31:33.529 --> 01:31:37.491
I'm looking forward to this... old man.

01:31:37.700 --> 01:31:39.326
R-Right...

01:31:41.370 --> 01:31:43.038
My, what terrible news.

01:31:43.247 --> 01:31:45.040
What's wrong?

01:31:45.249 --> 01:31:46.583
Apparently, the marriage
between Prince Odysseus

01:31:46.792 --> 01:31:50.421
and Empress Tianzi of the
Chinese Federation has been broken off.

01:31:50.629 --> 01:31:51.505
Huh?

01:31:51.714 --> 01:31:53.674
Word is that the youth are taking
charge of the Chinese Federation

01:31:53.882 --> 01:31:56.093
and joining forces with the Black Knights.

01:31:56.301 --> 01:31:57.761
Hmm...

01:31:58.721 --> 01:31:59.722
What is this?!

01:31:59.930 --> 01:32:04.977
Miso juice with burdock, habanero,
and apple in it. It will warm you up.

01:32:05.185 --> 01:32:08.022
Also, they seized the Guren
Flight-Enabled Version, pilot and all,

01:32:08.230 --> 01:32:09.732
and are sending them to Area 11.

01:32:09.940 --> 01:32:12.151
--Huh?!
-- I want one!

01:32:14.278 --> 01:32:18.365
Took you long enough.
So, is it gonna be torture? An execution?

01:32:18.574 --> 01:32:20.200
Do what you want with me!

01:32:20.409 --> 01:32:22.745
| won't do anything like that to you.

01:32:24.079 --> 01:32:26.915
It's been a long time, Kallen.

01:32:35.549 --> 01:32:39.678
I've finally grabbed it. The tail of Geass...

01:32:39.887 --> 01:32:42.347
I'll drag it out into the sunlight

01:32:42.556 --> 01:32:45.225
and wipe away the stain from Euphy's name!

01:32:50.606 --> 01:32:54.568
Suzaku, you're too late.
President Milly has already graduated.

01:32:54.777 --> 01:32:56.570
Huh? Then who's the
student council president?

01:32:56.779 --> 01:32:59.406
Lelouch turned it down,
so Rivalz has taken over.

01:32:59.615 --> 01:33:03.327
Oh. So, um, has Lelouch
been acting strangely at all?

01:33:03.535 --> 01:33:06.205
Nothing too unusual since I've met him.

01:33:06.413 --> 01:33:09.124
No, huh? All right.

01:33:09.333 --> 01:33:11.835
Gino, you were right about the Guren's pilot.

01:33:12.044 --> 01:33:15.089
| knew it. I knew I'd seen
her somewhere before.

01:33:15.297 --> 01:33:19.843
Yes, that's right, Suzaku.
The rooftop garden's finally finished.

01:33:20.052 --> 01:33:22.638
| can't keep avoiding the real world forever.

01:33:22.846 --> 01:33:25.349
I'm sorry. I'd like to be there
for your graduation event.

01:33:25.557 --> 01:33:28.352
| said I understood.
You have important work to do, right?

01:33:28.560 --> 01:33:29.812
Um, y-yeah.

01:33:30.020 --> 01:33:33.232
Well then, my last act for you will be
to cast my special magic spell!

01:33:33.440 --> 01:33:34.274
Huh?

01:33:34.483 --> 01:33:37.736
Relax!

01:33:37.945 --> 01:33:40.155
You have to loosen up from time to time.

01:33:40.364 --> 01:33:42.074
Thanks for that, Prez.

01:33:42.282 --> 01:33:45.244
<i>See ya!</i>

01:33:45.452 --> 01:33:47.121
H-Hold on.

01:33:47.329 --> 01:33:51.625
If that theory is correct,
we'd be the worst criminals in history!

01:33:51.834 --> 01:33:54.670
Let's get out of here!
We're through fine-tuning Jeremiah!

01:33:54.878 --> 01:33:56.463
But that would mean
abandoning our nation--

01:33:56.672 --> 01:33:59.091
Freeze! My dear Bartley...

01:33:59.299 --> 01:34:02.302
That voice... Princess Cornelia?!

01:34:02.511 --> 01:34:03.971
Why are you here?

01:34:04.179 --> 01:34:10.018
Th-Thank goodness! Please, save us!
We were ordered here by the emperor.

01:34:10.227 --> 01:34:10.978
My father?

01:34:11.186 --> 01:34:14.356
The world is on the path to destruction!

01:34:15.732 --> 01:34:19.236
It's all right. There are
no problems with Lelouch.

01:34:19.444 --> 01:34:23.490
Was Nebros ever one to smile like that before?

01:34:23.699 --> 01:34:26.994
Hello, and how do you do? I'm Milly Ashford!

01:34:27.202 --> 01:34:30.455
Starting today,
I'll be handling the weather corner!

01:34:30.664 --> 01:34:33.250
Let's start with a report on
that typhoon headed our way.

01:34:33.458 --> 01:34:36.336
She goes from being the student council
president to a weather report girl.

01:34:36.545 --> 01:34:37.629
When did she get qualified?

01:34:37.838 --> 01:34:40.549
In school. She also decided
on which agency to work for.

01:34:40.757 --> 01:34:41.758
Hmm...

01:34:41.967 --> 01:34:44.887
Yeah, I saw her. Typical Prez, right?

01:34:45.095 --> 01:34:48.390
So, what are we going to do
with the rooftop garden?

01:34:48.599 --> 01:34:51.894
Right. Well then, I'll bring back
some herb seedlings from the store.

01:34:52.102 --> 01:34:54.813
Can you ask the
gardening club about it, Lulu?

01:34:55.022 --> 01:34:56.773
Okay, later then!

01:34:59.526 --> 01:35:01.320
Huh?

01:35:01.528 --> 01:35:02.613
This is the eighth area, correct?

01:35:02.821 --> 01:35:06.617
Yes. But have the people
affected by the Geass power

01:35:06.825 --> 01:35:09.620
actually been deployed as secret police?

01:35:09.828 --> 01:35:12.164
We don't know,
which is why we're cleaning it up.

01:35:12.372 --> 01:35:14.249
You've been given a Geass Canceler,

01:35:14.458 --> 01:35:17.502
which can destroy all types
of Geass power. Therefore...

01:35:17.711 --> 01:35:21.840
Understood. We may not know
who is under the control of Geass,

01:35:22.049 --> 01:35:24.718
but once I'm done with Ashford Academy,

01:35:24.927 --> 01:35:26.678
| can take care of Lelouch.

01:35:37.022 --> 01:35:42.569
| remember. Lulu is probably
a member of the Black Knights, and...

01:35:42.778 --> 01:35:46.865
Huh? What about Nunna? The viceroy...?

01:35:49.910 --> 01:35:52.496
You are one of Lelouch's friends
from school, aren't you?

01:35:52.704 --> 01:35:54.164
| recognize you from my packet.

01:35:54.373 --> 01:35:58.085
Listen, I don't know anything!
| don't know, okay?

01:35:58.293 --> 01:35:59.336
That's all right.

01:35:59.544 --> 01:36:02.005
If you get in too deep because
the Geass has been released,

01:36:02.214 --> 01:36:04.299
| won't be able to safeguard your life.

01:36:04.508 --> 01:36:06.301
Huh? My life?

01:36:06.510 --> 01:36:12.266
Please. I don't wish to grieve
the two of you any further.

01:36:13.809 --> 01:36:19.398
| knew, Jeremiah, that you care
about the children of Marianne.

01:36:19.606 --> 01:36:22.276
Now, run off to wherever Lelouch is.

01:36:22.484 --> 01:36:25.529
Now we will know if this
Zero is the genuine article.

01:36:25.737 --> 01:36:28.073
As well as the whereabouts of C.C.

01:36:30.742 --> 01:36:35.831
Am I getting through to you, Rolo?
What does V.V. make of this Zero?

01:36:36.039 --> 01:36:38.250
He's the one who told me about Geass

01:36:38.458 --> 01:36:41.545
and sent me to Kamine Island
together with Sir Jeremiah.

01:36:41.753 --> 01:36:44.840
Isn't he the authority who
put a stop to the runaway Geass?

01:36:46.550 --> 01:36:48.343
Never mind.

01:36:50.721 --> 01:36:55.726
That's it. V.V. and His Majesty
have another objective.

01:36:55.934 --> 01:36:58.437
I'm just a pawn to that end.

01:37:00.814 --> 01:37:04.359
At this point, all I can do is meet with
Lelouch personally and see for myself.

01:37:04.568 --> 01:37:07.904
Hmm? Suzaku! You're back from the E.U.?

01:37:08.113 --> 01:37:10.073
| just got in. Is Lelouch inside?

01:37:10.282 --> 01:37:11.616
Yeah.

01:37:17.372 --> 01:37:22.502
Huh? Hey, if you were coming back,
you could have at least called. Hmm?

01:37:22.711 --> 01:37:23.628
What's that you're doing?

01:37:23.837 --> 01:37:27.549
Ah, so you don't know what this signal is.

01:37:50.405 --> 01:37:52.407
Where is Lelouch Lamperouge right now?!

01:37:52.616 --> 01:37:53.825
There's nothing out of the ordinary.

01:37:54.034 --> 01:37:55.702
I'm asking where he is!

01:37:55.911 --> 01:37:58.246
Where's Commander Villetta?!
What about his little brother?

01:37:58.455 --> 01:38:01.500
As I said, there's nothing
unusual worth reporting.

01:38:01.708 --> 01:38:03.585
Same as always.

01:38:03.794 --> 01:38:07.964
| see... The entire O.S.I. staff has been...!

01:38:11.927 --> 01:38:14.012
I'm terribly sorry, Master Lelouch.

01:38:14.221 --> 01:38:19.559
No, it's okay. It's thanks to you that
my copy has held out this long, Sayoko.

01:38:19.768 --> 01:38:24.064
Thanks to the time you've bought,
| can strike out at V.V., who set me up.

01:38:24.272 --> 01:38:28.276
Big brother, we could get rid
of Suzaku Kururugi right now.

01:38:28.485 --> 01:38:31.029
Britannia hasn't so much as flinched.

01:38:31.238 --> 01:38:32.614
For some reason I'm not aware of,

01:38:32.823 --> 01:38:35.325
Suzaku doesn't seem
to be reporting to his superiors.

01:38:35.534 --> 01:38:37.619
Let's let things sit.

01:38:37.828 --> 01:38:40.497
If something comes up, I'll count
on you to do what you always do.

01:38:40.705 --> 01:38:42.207
| trust you after all, Rolo.

01:38:42.416 --> 01:38:43.583
Mm-hmm.

01:38:43.792 --> 01:38:45.293
Now, take this.

01:38:45.502 --> 01:38:49.548
It's a bit early, but this is
a birthday present for you.

01:38:52.175 --> 01:38:54.886
Thank you, big brother.

01:38:58.014 --> 01:38:59.683
Calling Strike Force Kinoshita.

01:38:59.891 --> 01:39:02.394
We move in as soon as
Rolo opens the order's gate.

01:39:02.602 --> 01:39:03.854
You have command once inside.

01:39:04.062 --> 01:39:05.397
Understood.

01:39:05.605 --> 01:39:10.152
You're an absolute villain.
You have Rolo completely doing your bidding.

01:39:10.360 --> 01:39:13.905
I'm just giving the people who wish
for a place to belong what they want.

01:39:14.114 --> 01:39:15.949
You might be a little bit grateful.

01:39:16.158 --> 01:39:18.785
It's at least more artful than
using relationships as weapons

01:39:18.994 --> 01:39:20.162
the way Villetta does, right?

01:39:20.370 --> 01:39:22.414
Relationships...

01:39:22.622 --> 01:39:23.165
Is something wrong?

01:39:23.373 --> 01:39:27.586
No, I was just thinking, in my case,
if you had revealed yourself to me earlier,

01:39:27.794 --> 01:39:31.339
| could have come running to you right away,
when you were raising your forces.

01:39:31.548 --> 01:39:34.509
There is always that risk,
due to you remaining anonymous.

01:39:34.718 --> 01:39:39.139
Still, Lelouch, be more careful.
| may not always be able to keep you safe.

01:39:39.347 --> 01:39:42.309
| was barely able to keep
your memories protected.

01:39:42.517 --> 01:39:45.395
I'm the one who can't afford being
kissed each time it happens.

01:39:45.604 --> 01:39:48.648
And by a girl who kept the emperor's
Geass a secret from me, too.

01:39:48.857 --> 01:39:50.692
That's because you never asked.

01:39:50.901 --> 01:39:54.988
Besides, it wasn't me who
gave Charles his Geass. It was V.V.

01:39:55.197 --> 01:39:58.658
Master Lelouch, we don't
know what V.V.'s objective is,

01:39:58.867 --> 01:40:03.455
but it seems to me that he means
to impede--or rather, shun you.

01:40:03.663 --> 01:40:04.539
Which means that...

01:40:04.748 --> 01:40:09.002
Yeah, there's a chance that
he's prepared for our attack, huh?

01:40:11.421 --> 01:40:16.426
| never would have guessed...
that you were a princess, Nunnally.

01:40:16.635 --> 01:40:18.595
Forgive me for lying to you.

01:40:18.803 --> 01:40:20.138
Same from me.

01:40:20.347 --> 01:40:24.059
It's so nostalgic,
talking about Ashford Academy.

01:40:24.267 --> 01:40:27.521
They told me I wasn't
to see Milly and the others,

01:40:27.729 --> 01:40:30.357
so Suzaku is the only one
I've been able to talk to.

01:40:30.565 --> 01:40:34.110
They also tell me that my
big brother is nowhere to be found.

01:40:34.319 --> 01:40:36.655
What sort of brother was Lelouch to you?

01:40:36.863 --> 01:40:37.531
Huh?

01:40:37.739 --> 01:40:41.076
| used to have a big brother, too, so...

01:40:41.284 --> 01:40:44.996
I'm happy. Just to be able to talk about him...

01:40:46.414 --> 01:40:49.626
Was it C.C. that unlocked
the Geass that was used on Lelouch?

01:40:49.834 --> 01:40:51.795
She won't get away with that.

01:40:52.003 --> 01:40:53.588
How can she take its
absolute power to compel

01:40:53.797 --> 01:40:55.715
and unleash it on the world
rather than keep it under wraps?

01:40:55.924 --> 01:41:00.262
And Lelouch, you've tricked me once again!

01:41:00.470 --> 01:41:03.390
And this time, Nunnally, too!

01:41:03.598 --> 01:41:05.559
Lelouch...!

01:41:05.767 --> 01:41:08.144
Commander Kinoshita,
something's wrong here!

01:41:08.353 --> 01:41:11.439
Is this really a
Britannian military installation?

01:41:13.650 --> 01:41:16.152
No one here is to be considered innocent!

01:41:16.361 --> 01:41:17.195
Zero...

01:41:17.404 --> 01:41:20.323
Britannia has been colluding
with unlawful organizations,

01:41:20.532 --> 01:41:23.493
conducting research and
experiments on special soldiers.

01:41:23.702 --> 01:41:27.038
| won't allow these abominations
to the sanctity of life!

01:41:27.247 --> 01:41:30.125
The researchers and
their data are to be wiped out!

01:41:30.333 --> 01:41:32.961
We don't know where they have
their experimental subjects hidden!

01:41:33.169 --> 01:41:35.964
Therefore, encircle point alpha-7!

01:41:36.172 --> 01:41:38.883
Destroy everything! Burn it to the ground!

01:41:39.092 --> 01:41:41.261
Any possible experimental subjects found

01:41:41.469 --> 01:41:44.014
are all to be sealed inside
the high pressure case!

01:41:44.222 --> 01:41:46.683
| will verify them myself!

01:41:48.435 --> 01:41:51.062
Haven't you found Princess Cornelia yet?!

01:41:51.271 --> 01:41:53.565
We have to use this chance to save...

01:41:57.819 --> 01:41:58.945
That man...

01:41:59.154 --> 01:42:01.114
Wasn't he working with Clovis?

01:42:01.323 --> 01:42:02.574
Lady C.C.!

01:42:02.782 --> 01:42:04.200
You've come back to us!

01:42:04.409 --> 01:42:07.287
Please save us, Lady C.C.!

01:42:11.875 --> 01:42:14.377
P-Prince Clovis...

01:42:14.586 --> 01:42:19.174
The eternally young and immortal woman
you wished to present to His Majesty...

01:42:19.382 --> 01:42:23.261
It would seem he already
knew of her existence.

01:42:23.470 --> 01:42:27.932
P-Please forgive me...

01:42:28.141 --> 01:42:33.521
We should never have
involved ourselves with her...

01:42:35.315 --> 01:42:36.733
What?!

01:42:38.485 --> 01:42:39.486
The Siegfried!

01:42:39.694 --> 01:42:40.403
Impossible!

01:42:40.612 --> 01:42:42.447
Jeremiah! Isn't that unit...?!

01:42:42.656 --> 01:42:44.949
Right. Since it works via
direct electrical nerve connection,

01:42:45.158 --> 01:42:48.662
the only person besides me
who can use it is...!

01:42:48.870 --> 01:42:50.497
V.V.!

01:42:52.999 --> 01:42:54.209
You surprise me!

01:42:54.417 --> 01:42:57.504
The observer becomes the perpetrator!

01:42:57.712 --> 01:43:01.758
So your memories have returned, Lelouch.

01:43:01.966 --> 01:43:05.345
You really are just like Marianne.

01:43:05.553 --> 01:43:08.473
He's using the Siegfried of all things, here?!

01:43:08.682 --> 01:43:11.768
Get out of here! It's you he's after!

01:43:14.145 --> 01:43:14.604
Oh?

01:43:14.813 --> 01:43:16.523
Hold it right there, V.V.!

01:43:16.731 --> 01:43:18.650
Please, just surrender.

01:43:18.858 --> 01:43:21.569
What do you think you're saying? Traitors!

01:43:21.778 --> 01:43:24.656
V.V, I'll tear you out of that thing!

01:43:24.864 --> 01:43:26.491
All forces, commence attack!

01:43:26.700 --> 01:43:28.660
Yes, Your Majesty!

01:43:35.625 --> 01:43:38.169
Marianne's son may be
getting carried away!

01:43:42.173 --> 01:43:45.093
That machine was made
to let me show my loyalty!

01:43:45.301 --> 01:43:48.555
Jeremiah, I thought you hated Zero.

01:43:48.763 --> 01:43:53.560
| did! I thought he'd denied me
the ability to do my duty.

01:43:53.768 --> 01:43:56.688
But when I learned who he was,
| saw that I should serve him,

01:43:56.896 --> 01:43:58.815
for Lady Marianne's sake!

01:43:59.023 --> 01:44:01.776
Even you! You dare speak
that name in front of me?!

01:44:06.156 --> 01:44:07.991
Send out all remaining units!

01:44:08.199 --> 01:44:11.578
It looks like that monster outside
is being piloted by their director.

01:44:14.706 --> 01:44:17.417
Rolo! Can you grab
onto the Siegfried somehow?

01:44:17.625 --> 01:44:20.712
But I can't use my Geass on V.V.

01:44:20.920 --> 01:44:24.090
You just have to grab onto him.
| have a plan after you do that.

01:44:24.299 --> 01:44:26.259
Okay, I'll try.

01:44:26.468 --> 01:44:31.264
Rolo... it's time I say goodbye to you,
my phony little brother.

01:44:31.473 --> 01:44:35.393
With the bomb I planted on the Vincent!

01:44:35.602 --> 01:44:40.482
| have to try! For big brother's sake!

01:44:40.690 --> 01:44:44.611
And now it's you, Rolo.
You've lied to me too, haven't you?

01:44:44.819 --> 01:44:47.781
Even knowing your Geass won't work on me...

01:44:53.077 --> 01:44:53.870
Ah!

01:44:54.078 --> 01:44:56.956
Director V.V., we've finished
preparations to escape.

01:44:57.165 --> 01:44:59.709
Shall we head to the E.U. area for now?

01:44:59.918 --> 01:45:03.046
Right. I'll rendezvous with you
after I've finished things here.

01:45:03.254 --> 01:45:06.174
It's clear how to capture C.C. now.

01:45:06.382 --> 01:45:09.594
If we escape, then Charles and I win.

01:45:11.262 --> 01:45:12.555
| just have to grab on!

01:45:12.764 --> 01:45:15.725
You're a failed project, aren't you?

01:45:15.934 --> 01:45:19.604
After all, your heart stops
when you use your Geass.

01:45:19.813 --> 01:45:22.982
You're a defective experiment
we expected to die at any moment!

01:45:24.484 --> 01:45:27.153
Not yet! If I jettison them, then...!

01:45:27.362 --> 01:45:28.863
Oh?

01:45:29.072 --> 01:45:31.157
I've done it, big brother!

01:45:35.078 --> 01:45:36.579
Well done, Rolo!

01:45:36.788 --> 01:45:39.332
Now I must bid you farewell.

01:45:40.458 --> 01:45:41.960
Huh?

01:45:45.755 --> 01:45:49.843
Who? Who could know to
attack the Siegfried's weak point?

01:45:56.599 --> 01:46:01.229
So, your name is V.V.? I understand
you're the top man in this organization.

01:46:02.605 --> 01:46:04.148
Forgive me, big brother!

01:46:04.357 --> 01:46:06.734
No, don't worry about it.

01:46:06.943 --> 01:46:09.988
| never expected Cornelia to be here!

01:46:10.196 --> 01:46:12.240
The Siegfried's shields are down!

01:46:12.448 --> 01:46:13.950
Now, we just need to hit it directly!

01:46:15.285 --> 01:46:18.746
For Euphy's vengeance, you shall perish here!

01:46:18.955 --> 01:46:19.664
The source...

01:46:19.873 --> 01:46:21.416
...of Geass itself!

01:46:25.003 --> 01:46:28.381
I-It's no use! The Siegfried is finished!

01:46:32.635 --> 01:46:35.972
Lelouch! You accursed prince!

01:46:36.180 --> 01:46:37.557
Your Highness!

01:46:43.646 --> 01:46:46.065
Lelouch... How dare you?!

01:46:54.949 --> 01:46:58.244
I'm glad you came, Charles.

01:46:58.453 --> 01:47:01.706
In the end, siblings are
all you can count on, huh?

01:47:01.915 --> 01:47:07.795
Big brother, is it true you that you
tuned-up Jeremiah without telling me?

01:47:08.004 --> 01:47:12.634
What are you talking about? Never mind that,
| learned that Lelouch is Zero.

01:47:12.842 --> 01:47:14.469
He's a coward!

01:47:14.677 --> 01:47:18.306
You lied to me again, big brother.

01:47:25.521 --> 01:47:26.147
Chigusa.

01:47:26.356 --> 01:47:29.943
That was the name you called me
when I had lost my memory.

01:47:30.151 --> 01:47:32.695
My real name is...

01:47:32.904 --> 01:47:35.448
Villetta.

01:47:35.657 --> 01:47:37.200
But to me, you'll always be...

01:47:37.408 --> 01:47:39.827
| am a baroness of Britannia.

01:47:40.036 --> 01:47:42.413
If I don't erase the disgrace
of my having loved an Eleven,

01:47:42.622 --> 01:47:44.707
it will only be fodder for blackmail.

01:47:44.916 --> 01:47:46.751
| suppose so.

01:47:46.960 --> 01:47:49.545
If it has to be this way,
| wished I could have died in Japan.

01:47:49.754 --> 01:47:52.674
You came here knowing
| was going to kill you?

01:47:52.882 --> 01:47:55.843
If I have to die, I want to
at least choose when it'll happen.

01:47:56.052 --> 01:47:58.930
You could also kill me if you wanted to.

01:47:59.138 --> 01:48:02.892
Why did a terrorist even save
a Britannian soldier in the first place?!

01:48:03.101 --> 01:48:06.396
At first, I thought I could get
information about Zero from you.

01:48:06.604 --> 01:48:08.648
| tricked you, kept you under surveillance...

01:48:08.856 --> 01:48:11.818
But... as we lived together...

01:48:12.026 --> 01:48:13.152
I'm the enemy!

01:48:13.361 --> 01:48:14.696
But I still love you!

01:48:14.904 --> 01:48:16.364
Are you insane?!

01:48:16.572 --> 01:48:20.326
Yes, you're the enemy. Yes, it may be crazy...

01:48:20.535 --> 01:48:24.205
But I've fallen in love with you!

01:48:24.414 --> 01:48:27.625
| wish I'd never met you!

01:48:27.834 --> 01:48:30.003
Y-You! From the intelligence division!

01:48:31.629 --> 01:48:34.924
"United States of Japan Provisional Capital -
Horai Island"

01:48:35.133 --> 01:48:38.928
"Black Knights Flagship - lkaruga"

01:48:39.137 --> 01:48:42.306
| see. Deputy Commander Ohgi, huh?

01:48:42.515 --> 01:48:44.767
Yes. I was about to report
this to Master Zero, too.

01:48:44.976 --> 01:48:47.270
No, I'll take care of this matter.

01:48:47.478 --> 01:48:47.895
Huh?

01:48:48.104 --> 01:48:51.482
Issues within the organization
should be dealt with internally.

01:48:51.691 --> 01:48:55.403
We need Zero's undivided
attention on Britannia.

01:48:55.403 --> 01:48:55.695
"Holy Britannian Empire - Dallas Research Center"
We need Zero's undivided attention on Britannia.

01:48:55.695 --> 01:48:57.822
"Holy Britannian Empire -
Dallas Research Center"

01:48:57.822 --> 01:49:00.241
"Holy Britannian Empire - Dallas Research
Center" Forgive me. I had to talk to Nunnally.

01:49:00.241 --> 01:49:01.159
Forgive me. I had to talk to Nunnally.

01:49:01.367 --> 01:49:03.119
It's all right. We're not ready to start yet.

01:49:03.327 --> 01:49:04.495
What happened?

01:49:04.704 --> 01:49:08.541
You know the subject. The new
Knightmare for Lloyd's Camelot group.

01:49:08.750 --> 01:49:10.626
No, I meant with the Tromo Agency.

01:49:10.835 --> 01:49:14.505
That... depends on the results of today's test.

01:49:14.714 --> 01:49:18.259
Yes. My big brother Schneizel
contacted me from the homeland.

01:49:18.468 --> 01:49:21.888
It looks like we'll be able to raise
Area 11's status to satellite area.

01:49:22.096 --> 01:49:23.097
He said it's in recognition

01:49:23.306 --> 01:49:25.933
of the stabilized public order
and higher productivity.

01:49:26.142 --> 01:49:28.144
That's good news.

01:49:28.352 --> 01:49:30.438
Lelouch must have been Zero all this time.

01:49:30.646 --> 01:49:33.816
But if I report that to the emperor,
what will happen to Nunnally?

01:49:34.025 --> 01:49:40.490
If Lelouch regains his memories,
then I shall use Nunnally.

01:49:40.698 --> 01:49:43.743
Suzaku, you aren't hiding
anything from me, are you?

01:49:43.951 --> 01:49:48.247
Of course not. You're the one person
I'd never lie to, Nunnally.

01:50:01.886 --> 01:50:03.221
What?!

01:50:11.813 --> 01:50:17.527
When did I get out of the Shinkiro?
And where am I? It isn't a hologram.

01:50:17.735 --> 01:50:19.862
Correct!

01:50:20.071 --> 01:50:23.825
And Knightmares are such inelegant things.

01:50:24.033 --> 01:50:28.538
Especially in the face of this system:
The Sword of Akasha!

01:50:28.746 --> 01:50:29.747
You...!

01:50:29.956 --> 01:50:34.127
Lelouch, my son! The time has come at last!

01:50:34.335 --> 01:50:37.421
The time for redemption!

01:50:38.756 --> 01:50:40.883
Answer the question
| asked you eight years ago!

01:50:41.092 --> 01:50:42.927
Why didn't you protect Mother?!

01:50:43.136 --> 01:50:46.305
Even knowing how the
other members of royalty ostracized her!

01:50:46.514 --> 01:50:49.058
People are not equal.

01:50:49.267 --> 01:50:49.725
What?!

01:50:49.934 --> 01:50:54.272
You have Geass, a power
which no one else possesses.

01:50:54.480 --> 01:50:57.316
Use that power to get the answer from me!

01:50:57.525 --> 01:51:02.071
He's baiting me. Inviting me
to use my Geass on him. But...

01:51:02.280 --> 01:51:07.743
What's wrong? Are you not my son?
Not a prince of Britannia?

01:51:07.952 --> 01:51:10.830
This is no time to choose tepid commands!

01:51:11.038 --> 01:51:13.708
That's right! It was Zero's orders!

01:51:13.916 --> 01:51:17.170
Search through all of the facilities!
Obey Zero's orders!

01:51:17.378 --> 01:51:19.881
Gather all of the dead
in the designated area.

01:51:20.089 --> 01:51:21.299
We're going to verify whether any of them

01:51:21.507 --> 01:51:23.259
are Britannian experimental soldiers.

01:51:23.467 --> 01:51:26.470
This is... a massacre!

01:51:26.679 --> 01:51:28.014
Bartley...

01:51:28.222 --> 01:51:32.059
| hated you for
reconstructing me with this body.

01:51:32.268 --> 01:51:35.771
But your loyalty to the
imperial family was genuine.

01:51:35.980 --> 01:51:41.611
Which is precisely why
| have committed myself to honor you!

01:51:46.365 --> 01:51:48.701
Lelouch vi Britannia commands you!

01:51:48.910 --> 01:51:50.453
You...

01:51:50.661 --> 01:51:52.663
...must die!

01:52:01.339 --> 01:52:03.716
Very well, then.

01:52:24.654 --> 01:52:26.280
| won?

01:52:27.823 --> 01:52:29.116
| won.

01:52:30.243 --> 01:52:33.287
Nunnally... Mother...

01:52:33.496 --> 01:52:36.832
I--- I---

01:52:45.675 --> 01:52:49.470
How many years has it been since
we were together face to face, V.V.?

01:52:49.679 --> 01:52:54.558
In the end, I couldn't run away
from my destiny, could 1?

01:52:54.767 --> 01:52:57.186
| will shoulder...

01:52:58.729 --> 01:53:01.941
...this destiny...

01:53:02.149 --> 01:53:04.235
The destiny of immortality...

01:53:04.443 --> 01:53:05.695
What's...?

01:53:05.903 --> 01:53:07.196
V.V., are you...?

01:53:07.405 --> 01:53:10.783
So please, Charles...

01:53:10.992 --> 01:53:15.371
Because... I am... your big brother...

01:53:15.579 --> 01:53:19.875
| killed him. It was so easy.

01:53:20.084 --> 01:53:22.253
There were things I wanted to ask him.

01:53:22.461 --> 01:53:25.548
People I wanted to make
him apologize to! And now...

01:53:25.756 --> 01:53:28.884
Oh? To whom?

01:53:29.093 --> 01:53:32.680
You're an impudent child, Lelouch!

01:53:32.888 --> 01:53:35.766
You're alive?! Impossible!
You shot your own heart!

01:53:35.975 --> 01:53:39.103
Schemes, plots, surprise attacks...

01:53:39.312 --> 01:53:44.442
You really thought you could
defeat me with those cheap tricks?

01:53:44.650 --> 01:53:50.281
Come at me as a true king would!
If you wish to inherit the power of the king!

01:53:50.489 --> 01:53:51.991
Die!

01:53:52.992 --> 01:53:55.244
You call that the path of royalty?!

01:53:55.453 --> 01:53:57.538
My Geass isn't working!

01:54:01.959 --> 01:54:07.923
Don't you understand, Lelouch?!
| am beyond the power of guns or swords!

01:54:08.132 --> 01:54:11.677
No matter what you use
against me, it will be useless!

01:54:14.388 --> 01:54:18.809
Charles, why steal V.V.'s Code now?

01:54:19.018 --> 01:54:23.773
Why would you kill the
older brother you loved so much?

01:54:23.981 --> 01:54:25.316
V.V...

01:54:25.524 --> 01:54:30.029
You loved Marianne too, didn't you?

01:54:32.365 --> 01:54:37.119
He's become immortal, too?!
| can't win. There's no way I can win!

01:54:37.328 --> 01:54:42.208
I've gained a new power in the place of Geass.

01:54:42.416 --> 01:54:49.173
And so, Lelouch, I shall now
show you the true nature of this world!

01:54:59.016 --> 01:55:00.726
What is this?!

01:55:06.565 --> 01:55:09.318
What is this place? What are you up to?!

01:55:09.527 --> 01:55:11.153
How strange.

01:55:11.362 --> 01:55:15.825
A child who's covered with
lies desires the truth from others.

01:55:16.033 --> 01:55:16.617
What?

01:55:16.826 --> 01:55:20.204
There's no need to tell lies.

01:55:20.413 --> 01:55:25.000
It's true. In this entire world,
there need only be a single person.

01:55:25.209 --> 01:55:28.504
One single person.

01:55:28.712 --> 01:55:30.131
What are you talking about?

01:55:30.339 --> 01:55:31.841
Charles.

01:55:33.884 --> 01:55:36.178
Play time is over.

01:55:36.387 --> 01:55:39.390
There's nothing in it for me now.

01:55:39.598 --> 01:55:40.766
C.C.?

01:55:40.975 --> 01:55:44.520
You don't have to cajole him
like this to call me here.

01:55:44.728 --> 01:55:47.356
| already exist here.

01:55:47.565 --> 01:55:52.862
True enough, C.C.
| shall grant your wish, then.

01:55:53.070 --> 01:55:54.905
You know what C.C.'s wish is?!

01:55:55.114 --> 01:55:58.367
Lelouch... It's time you knew
the conditions of our contract

01:55:58.576 --> 01:56:00.619
and what my wish is.

01:56:03.581 --> 01:56:10.087
| wish to die. To end my existence forever.

01:56:10.296 --> 01:56:13.340
End it? But, you're...!

01:56:13.549 --> 01:56:14.800
In the final stage of Geass,

01:56:15.009 --> 01:56:18.220
the user attains the position of
the one who granted them the power.

01:56:18.429 --> 01:56:21.432
In other words, you gain the power to kill me.

01:56:21.640 --> 01:56:24.310
To... kill you?

01:56:24.518 --> 01:56:29.440
Not one of the many people I made
contracts with ever reached that point.

01:56:29.648 --> 01:56:33.402
But now we have Charles here,
who has done it.

01:56:33.611 --> 01:56:37.531
This can't be! You made your contract
with me so that you could die?!

01:56:37.740 --> 01:56:38.741
Correct.

01:56:38.949 --> 01:56:41.243
You were living just so that you could die?

01:56:41.452 --> 01:56:43.829
That is where the
providence of this world lies.

01:56:44.038 --> 01:56:46.499
Life is defined by its limits.

01:56:46.707 --> 01:56:49.210
That's wrong!
We call it life because we're alive!

01:56:49.418 --> 01:56:53.839
It's the same thing. We can
acknowledge life because death exists.

01:56:54.048 --> 01:56:55.758
That's just wordplay!

01:56:55.966 --> 01:56:57.885
Even so, people do die.

01:56:58.093 --> 01:57:01.138
Then what's the reason people
are born into this world?! The meaning!

01:57:01.347 --> 01:57:04.892
You know perfectly well!
Those things are just illusions.

01:57:05.100 --> 01:57:07.394
Living just to die is
too sad to even consider!

01:57:07.603 --> 01:57:10.898
Endless accumulation of it
without death can't be called a life.

01:57:11.106 --> 01:57:14.109
That's just experiences.

01:57:14.318 --> 01:57:17.488
If you have a reason for living, then kill me.

01:57:17.696 --> 01:57:22.326
Do that, and you'll be Charles's equal.
You will gain the power to fight.

01:57:26.664 --> 01:57:29.124
Farewell, Lelouch.

01:57:29.333 --> 01:57:31.710
You're just too kindhearted.

01:57:31.919 --> 01:57:33.754
Wait! You're...

01:57:41.929 --> 01:57:45.307
Charles, why did you steal V.V.'s Code?

01:57:45.516 --> 01:57:47.810
Is there any point to asking questions now?

01:57:48.018 --> 01:57:50.062
After all, you're about to die.

01:57:50.271 --> 01:57:52.773
| suppose not.

01:57:52.982 --> 01:57:56.652
The people who hated me,
the ones who were kind to me...

01:57:56.860 --> 01:58:00.239
All of them eventually
vanished in the flow of time.

01:58:00.447 --> 01:58:02.866
In the endless flow of time...

01:58:03.075 --> 01:58:06.328
But now, those days of torment...

01:58:06.537 --> 01:58:11.333
Yes. Now it ends. My long journey...

01:58:11.542 --> 01:58:13.502
C.C.!

01:58:13.711 --> 01:58:15.921
You've opened it, Lelouch!

01:58:16.130 --> 01:58:19.091
The Thought Elevator!

01:58:19.300 --> 01:58:25.723
Now I understand! This area of space
itself is a system for disrupting thought!

01:58:25.931 --> 01:58:27.641
Soon it will be over.

01:58:27.850 --> 01:58:31.645
Lelouch, sit where you are and watch!

01:58:41.780 --> 01:58:46.035
Stop it! She's my... my...!

01:58:47.244 --> 01:58:48.704
Answer me, C.C.!

01:58:48.912 --> 01:58:51.457
Why didn't you try to die
by making me take your place?

01:58:51.665 --> 01:58:56.962
You could have forced me
to accept the hell of eternal life!

01:58:57.171 --> 01:59:00.633
Did you pity me, C.C.?!

01:59:02.217 --> 01:59:06.013
Don't die looking like that!
When death comes, die smiling!

01:59:06.221 --> 01:59:09.475
| promise, I'll make you smile! So, please!

01:59:11.518 --> 01:59:14.271
What do you think you're doing, C.C.?

01:59:16.273 --> 01:59:18.817
You think I'll let you steal any more from me?!

01:59:21.779 --> 01:59:24.573
Does your foolishness know no bounds?!

01:59:34.958 --> 01:59:35.959
C.C.!

01:59:36.168 --> 01:59:39.838
We're getting out of this space!
The emperor will be the only one left here!

01:59:40.047 --> 01:59:43.300
Then I'll make your true wish come true!

01:59:43.509 --> 01:59:45.886
Come on! Turn towards me!

01:59:55.396 --> 01:59:57.648
Activation of F.L.E.I.J.A., confirmed.

01:59:57.856 --> 01:59:59.066
It worked.

01:59:59.274 --> 02:00:02.528
| can't believe the explosive force generated!

02:00:02.736 --> 02:00:04.738
Congratulations, Chief!

02:00:04.947 --> 02:00:07.825
Oh, no. This is the result
of the entire staff at Invogue.

02:00:08.033 --> 02:00:13.580
You should be proud, Nina. You are a genius.

02:00:13.789 --> 02:00:20.337
I'm honored, Prince Schneizel.
Now mankind... War itself will change!

02:00:20.546 --> 02:00:23.966
Mm-hmm. Now can come Damocles!

02:00:25.843 --> 02:00:29.596
Hey! We've come back, C.C.! Wake up!

02:00:31.849 --> 02:00:35.060
I've contacted Rolo.
We'll use him to get out of here soon.

02:00:35.269 --> 02:00:37.187
Um, who are you, sir?

02:00:37.396 --> 02:00:40.566
What are you talking about? Anyway,
about the emperor and that system...

02:00:40.774 --> 02:00:43.902
Are you my new master?

02:00:44.111 --> 02:00:47.281
| can help prepare food
for cooking and can clean.

02:00:47.489 --> 02:00:50.534
| can fetch water and
tend cows and sheep. And sew.

02:00:50.743 --> 02:00:54.371
| can read a little and I can count to twenty.

02:00:54.580 --> 02:00:57.416
And... I can also tend corpses, if you wish...

02:00:58.459 --> 02:01:04.882
"U.F.N. Charter Ratification Ceremony Site"

02:01:10.053 --> 02:01:12.222
We're coming to you over Horai Island.

02:01:12.431 --> 02:01:16.935
The ratification ceremony for
the united states charter is about to begin.

02:01:18.228 --> 02:01:21.523
| see. You hid her inside
the Sutherland's cockpit.

02:01:21.732 --> 02:01:26.028
Please forgive me, Lord Lelouch.
You ordered me to destroy them,

02:01:26.236 --> 02:01:28.864
but killing a member of the
Britannian royal family was just...

02:01:29.072 --> 02:01:29.740
Forget it.

02:01:29.948 --> 02:01:32.159
Rather, I should say, well done.

02:01:32.367 --> 02:01:36.622
Lelouch... What is it you seek
with that accursed power?

02:01:36.830 --> 02:01:40.834
Sister... All I wish to do
is save my little sister.

02:01:41.043 --> 02:01:42.836
You dare to say that!

02:01:46.215 --> 02:01:48.425
As everyone watching
this broadcast has seen,

02:01:48.634 --> 02:01:52.846
all 47 nations have just ratified
the united states charter.

02:01:53.222 --> 02:01:54.181
"Area 11 - Tokyo Settlement"

02:01:54.181 --> 02:01:56.308
"Area 11 - Tokyo Settlement"
Sir Gilbert, we've finished preparations

02:01:56.308 --> 02:01:56.517
"Area 11 - Tokyo Settlement"

02:01:56.517 --> 02:01:57.601
"Area 11 - Tokyo Settlement"
for your review of the troops.

02:01:57.601 --> 02:01:57.810
"Area 11 - Tokyo Settlement"

02:01:57.810 --> 02:01:59.228
"Area 11 - Tokyo Settlement"
Right. On my way.

02:01:59.228 --> 02:01:59.645
Right. On my way.

02:02:01.104 --> 02:02:03.440
What? If it's about the troop review...

02:02:03.649 --> 02:02:06.068
Sir Gilbert.

02:02:06.276 --> 02:02:08.403
Orange?

02:02:08.612 --> 02:02:11.490
Finally, article 17
of the united states charter.

02:02:11.490 --> 02:02:11.990
"U.F.N. Supreme Council Chairman: Kaguya Sumeragi (Rep.
- United States of Japan)” Finally, article 17 of the united states charter.

02:02:11.990 --> 02:02:12.199
"U.F.N. Supreme Council Chairman:
Kaguya Sumeragi (Rep. - United States of Japan)"

02:02:12.199 --> 02:02:14.451
"U.F.N. Supreme Council Chairman: Kaguya Sumeragi (Rep.
- United States of Japan)” All ratifying nations to the united states charter

02:02:14.451 --> 02:02:14.660
"U.F.N. Supreme Council Chairman:
Kaguya Sumeragi (Rep. - United States of Japan)"

02:02:14.660 --> 02:02:17.120
"U.F.N. Supreme Council Chairman: Kaguya Sumeragi (Rep.
- United States of Japan)” do hereby abandon native military power forever.

02:02:17.120 --> 02:02:17.329
Do hereby abandon
native military power forever.

02:02:17.538 --> 02:02:20.749
To guarantee the security
of each member nation instead,

02:02:20.958 --> 02:02:23.836
we contract that to the Black Knights,

02:02:24.044 --> 02:02:25.963
a fighting force not affiliated
with any one country.

02:02:26.171 --> 02:02:28.298
This contract has been accepted.

02:02:28.507 --> 02:02:33.345
We will take funding
and personnel from the U.F.N.

02:02:33.554 --> 02:02:37.558
In return, we will become the shield
to defend every member nation

02:02:37.766 --> 02:02:40.352
and the sword to oppose any external foe!

02:02:41.645 --> 02:02:43.564
The source of disturbances
in the world is the possession

02:02:43.772 --> 02:02:45.399
of military power by disparate nations.

02:02:45.607 --> 02:02:48.110
The U.F.N. shall only use
military force according to a resolution

02:02:48.110 --> 02:02:49.820
"U.F.N. (Chinese Representative): Tianzi" The U.F.N.
shall only use military force according to a resolution

02:02:49.820 --> 02:02:50.028
"U.F.N. (Chinese Representative): Tianzi"

02:02:50.028 --> 02:02:52.114
"U.F.N. (Chinese Representative): Tianzi"
by the supreme council.

02:02:52.114 --> 02:02:52.322
"U.F.N. (Chinese Representative): Tianzi"

02:02:52.322 --> 02:02:53.907
"U.F.N. (Chinese Representative): Tianzi"
And so, I shall put forward our first motion.

02:02:53.907 --> 02:02:55.367
And so, I shall put forward our first motion.

02:02:55.576 --> 02:02:57.661
The land of the people
of the United States of Japan

02:02:57.870 --> 02:03:02.082
continues to be held in an
unjust occupation by a foreign power.

02:03:02.291 --> 02:03:05.252
| wish to request that the
Black Knights be dispatched.

02:03:05.460 --> 02:03:07.671
All those in favor, please rise.

02:03:11.258 --> 02:03:13.719
By overwhelming majority,

02:03:13.927 --> 02:03:15.345
under U.F.N. Resolution number 1,

02:03:15.554 --> 02:03:20.559
the Black Knights shall
be dispatched to liberate Japan.

02:03:20.767 --> 02:03:24.229
Very well! Under U.F.N. Resolution number 1,

02:03:24.438 --> 02:03:26.648
our first operational objective shall be...

02:03:26.857 --> 02:03:28.358
...Japan!

02:03:32.863 --> 02:03:34.239
Zero!

02:03:34.448 --> 02:03:35.991
Wh-What?!

02:03:36.199 --> 02:03:37.034
We've been hacked?!

02:03:37.242 --> 02:03:39.077
It's coming in from 14 routes!

02:03:39.286 --> 02:03:42.122
Use the auxiliary lines! Cut the link!

02:03:42.331 --> 02:03:44.166
We can't! They've gotten
into the auxiliaries as well!

02:03:44.374 --> 02:03:48.795
Zero... You thought you could
get the jump on me?

02:03:49.004 --> 02:03:51.715
Impossible! He got out of that space?!

02:03:51.924 --> 02:03:54.426
Still, I don't mind.

02:03:54.635 --> 02:03:58.221
The E.U., which once comprised
a third of the world, is already dead.

02:03:58.430 --> 02:04:01.183
All this annoying charter you've created does

02:04:01.391 --> 02:04:05.604
is serve to differentiate Britannia
from the rest of the world on a map.

02:04:05.812 --> 02:04:08.231
I'm just being simple and clear about this.

02:04:08.440 --> 02:04:14.780
After all, whomever succeeds
in this battle shall control the world.

02:04:14.988 --> 02:04:18.617
So, very well, Zero. Have at me.

02:04:18.825 --> 02:04:22.663
Will you win everything or lose everything?

02:04:22.871 --> 02:04:25.540
That is the essential nature of war.

02:04:25.749 --> 02:04:30.212
All hail Britannia!

02:04:30.420 --> 02:04:31.338
All hail Britannia! All hail Britannia!

02:04:31.338 --> 02:04:34.007
"Area 11 - Yokosuka Base"
All hail Britannia! All hail Britannia!

02:04:34.007 --> 02:04:34.049
"Area 11 - Yokosuka Base"

02:04:34.216 --> 02:04:36.051
Long live Japan!

02:04:36.259 --> 02:04:37.010
Long live...

02:04:37.219 --> 02:04:38.303
...Japan!

02:04:38.512 --> 02:04:42.432
All hail Britannia!
All hail Britannia!

02:04:42.641 --> 02:04:44.434
Long live Japan!

02:04:44.643 --> 02:04:49.189
Long live Japan! Long live Japan! Long live...

02:04:50.816 --> 02:04:52.818
The emperor has returned.

02:04:53.026 --> 02:04:55.612
U-Um, welcome back.

02:04:55.821 --> 02:05:00.909
This isn't good. I have to rescue
Nunnally at once. At once!

02:05:03.954 --> 02:05:08.083
| could play the Cornelia card...
No. Hostages would have no effect on him.

02:05:08.291 --> 02:05:12.295
Maybe use Jeremiah and Rolo...
No, Geass doesn't work on him now!

02:05:12.504 --> 02:05:14.881
Do I reveal to the world
that Zero is actually Lelouch?

02:05:15.090 --> 02:05:17.759
But if I reveal that
their leader is an enemy prince,

02:05:17.968 --> 02:05:19.845
the Black Knights will fall apart!

02:05:20.053 --> 02:05:21.346
Even if I rescue Nunnally,

02:05:21.555 --> 02:05:24.391
it'll be meaningless if there's
no country that would accept us!

02:05:24.599 --> 02:05:27.853
Dammit, what do I do?!

02:05:28.061 --> 02:05:31.898
Um, here. I kept this piece for you, master.

02:05:32.107 --> 02:05:35.444
| don't think you had any breakfast today.

02:05:35.652 --> 02:05:36.778
Um, please take it...

02:05:36.987 --> 02:05:38.780
Shut up!

02:05:47.372 --> 02:05:48.331
Hey...

02:05:48.540 --> 02:05:51.209
Forgive me! I'll clean it up at once!

02:05:51.418 --> 02:05:53.086
No, forget that!

02:05:53.295 --> 02:05:54.755
You're bleeding.

02:05:54.963 --> 02:06:00.635
What? I'm fine. This happens
to me all the time. I'm fine.

02:06:13.982 --> 02:06:16.068
Yes?

02:06:16.276 --> 02:06:17.486
Suzaku?

02:06:17.694 --> 02:06:18.528
Lelouch?

02:06:18.737 --> 02:06:22.240
Yeah. Um, have you seen the news?

02:06:22.449 --> 02:06:26.036
Yeah. Now Area 11 will
become a battlefield again.

02:06:26.244 --> 02:06:28.330
The Tokyo Settlement will be
in danger again too, won't it?

02:06:28.538 --> 02:06:30.373
That depends on what you decide.

02:06:30.582 --> 02:06:31.958
Huh?

02:06:32.167 --> 02:06:39.257
Lelouch... Are you still Zero?

02:06:39.466 --> 02:06:41.176
Yes.

02:06:41.384 --> 02:06:43.720
| am Zero.

02:06:43.929 --> 02:06:46.264
So, what does an enemy
of Britannia want with me?

02:06:46.473 --> 02:06:49.726
I'm begging you. Please, save Nunnally!

02:06:49.935 --> 02:06:53.647
The emperor is using Nunnally
as a hostage to pin me down.

02:06:53.855 --> 02:06:56.608
That's why I had no choice
but to operate in secret!

02:06:58.485 --> 02:07:02.114
Please, Suzaku! You're the
only person left I can ask this of!

02:07:02.322 --> 02:07:06.368
You think your requests mean
anything to me at this point?!

02:07:06.576 --> 02:07:09.830
No, I don't. But you're the only one I can ask!

02:07:10.038 --> 02:07:10.914
How selfish.

02:07:11.123 --> 02:07:16.545
| know. But you're all I have. All I have!

02:07:16.753 --> 02:07:21.758
Please! Nunnally... Nunnally...

02:07:21.967 --> 02:07:23.593
Please, protect her!

02:07:31.810 --> 02:07:36.022
Are we going to stay in another house?

02:07:36.231 --> 02:07:38.733
It's another of the Kururugi's houses.

02:07:38.942 --> 02:07:41.361
We're headed for the
main family house this time.

02:07:46.324 --> 02:07:48.118
Keep walking, Suzaku.

02:07:48.326 --> 02:07:48.702
But...

02:07:48.910 --> 02:07:50.203
Keep walking.

02:07:51.496 --> 02:07:54.499
What's that strange smell?

02:07:54.708 --> 02:07:58.044
We're near a garbage dump. Right, Suzaku?

02:08:05.343 --> 02:08:08.180
Suzaku, what's wrong?

02:08:08.388 --> 02:08:11.600
I--- I----

02:08:15.270 --> 02:08:16.188
Nunnally...

02:08:16.396 --> 02:08:21.193
My mother taught me that
a warm touch is good for tears.

02:08:37.083 --> 02:08:45.050
Yeah, I know. As Euphy's knight, I must...

02:08:45.258 --> 02:08:47.427
...face Lelouch.

02:08:47.719 --> 02:08:55.852
Nobody gives a second thought
to vanishing illusions

02:08:56.061 --> 02:09:04.069
Will you deprive me of
everything to correct my mistake?

02:09:04.277 --> 02:09:22.837
Ah, thinking there's no point
if we can't see eye-to-eye, I give up

02:09:23.046 --> 02:09:31.263
Whom do I keep moving
forward for, breathlessly?

02:09:31.471 --> 02:09:35.141
I'm just aware of love

02:09:35.350 --> 02:09:40.230
Isn't that true for you, too?

02:09:48.238 --> 02:09:56.413
It seems like I'm being directed
by someone's eyes, even now

02:09:56.621 --> 02:10:04.713
Hatred keeps going around,
side-by-side with hope

02:10:04.921 --> 02:10:13.096
Ah, too twisted to see straight

02:10:13.305 --> 02:10:22.105
I'm sure she was searching, as well

02:10:23.857 --> 02:10:31.906
Swimming across these skies, breathlessly,

02:10:32.115 --> 02:10:35.577
though I raise my voice, I can't get through

02:10:35.785 --> 02:10:39.914
Isn't that because of you?

02:11:05.690 --> 02:11:13.948
Ah, if you can't forgive me

02:11:14.157 --> 02:11:22.832
then I'd rather you let go of my hand

02:11:26.753 --> 02:11:34.677
Whom do I keep moving
forward for, breathlessly?

02:11:34.886 --> 02:11:38.598
I loved you, that's all

02:11:38.807 --> 02:11:43.269
What about you?

02:11:43.478 --> 02:11:51.486
After I've acquired everything else there is

02:11:51.694 --> 02:11:55.198
I'm now waiting only for love

02:11:55.407 --> 02:11:59.911
Isn't that true for you, too?

02:12:00.120 --> 02:12:03.706
I loved you, that's all

02:12:03.915 --> 02:12:07.669
Wasn't that true for you, too?

02:12:39.451 --> 02:12:42.203
"Diverging paths”

02:12:42.412 --> 02:12:43.788
"Resolve and responsibility"

02:12:43.997 --> 02:12:46.458
"Yesterday and today"

02:12:46.666 --> 02:12:51.045
"What does tomorrow have in store?"

02:12:52.380 --> 02:12:56.759
"Part Il Glorification
Opens 5/26/2018"
